#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:3
msgid "Add applicants"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:5
msgid ""
"Once an applicant submits an application, either using the online "
"application, or emailing a job position alias, an applicant card is "
"automatically created in the **Recruitment** app."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:8
msgid ""
"However, in some instances, applicants may need to be created manually in "
"the database. This could be necessary if, for example, a company accepts "
"paper applications in the mail, or is meeting prospective applicants at an "
"in-person job fair."
msgstr ""
"Въпреки това, в някои случаи може да се наложи кандидатите да бъдат "
"създавани ръчно в базата данни. Това може да е необходимо, например, ако "
"дадена фирма приема хартиени кандидатури по пощата или се среща с "
"потенциални кандидати на кариерен форум."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:12
msgid ""
"To view current applicants, navigate to the :menuselection:`Recruitment` "
"app, then click the desired job position card. Doing so reveals the "
"*Applications* page, which displays all applicants for that specific role, "
"in a default Kanban view, organized by stage."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:16
msgid ""
"Add applicants from a job position's *Applications* page by using either "
"the :icon:`fa-plus` :ref:`(quick add) <recruitment/add_applicants/quick-add-"
"applicant>` button, or the :ref:`New <recruitment/add_applicants/create-new-"
"applicant>` button."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:23
msgid "Quick add"
msgstr "Бързо добавяне"

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:25
msgid ""
"On the job position's *Applications* page, click the :icon:`fa-"
"plus` :guilabel:`(Quick add)` button in the corner of the desired stage, and "
"a new applicant card loads."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:28
msgid "Enter the following information on the card:"
msgstr "Въведете следната информация в картата:"

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:30
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Applicant's Name`: Enter the applicant's name in this field. This "
"is displayed as the card title in the Kanban view of the *Applications* page."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:32
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Job Position`: The current job position populates this field. To "
"change it, select a different job position from the drop-down menu. The "
"newly-created card then appears on the *Applications* page for that selected "
"job position."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:36
msgid ""
"After the information is entered, click :guilabel:`Add`. This adds the "
"applicant card to the stage, and a new blank applicant card appears."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:39
msgid ""
"If preferred, after entering the :guilabel:`Applicant's Name` in the Kanban "
"card, click :guilabel:`Edit`, and a detailed applicant form "
"loads. :ref:`Enter the information <recruitment/add_applicants/create-new-"
"applicant>` on the new applicant form."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:None
msgid ""
"All the fields for a new applicant form entered when using the Quick Add "
"option."
msgstr ""
"Всички попълнени полета на формуляра за нов кандидат при използване на "
"опцията за бързо добавяне."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:49
msgid "New applicant form"
msgstr "Формуляр за нов кандидат"

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:51
msgid ""
"On the *Applications* page, click the :guilabel:`New` button in the corner, "
"and a blank *Applications* form loads."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:54
msgid ""
"By default, the :guilabel:`Job Position` and :guilabel:`Recruiter` fields "
"are populated according to the :ref:`job position configurations "
"<recruitment/new_job/create-job-position>`. Additionally, "
"the :guilabel:`Department` and :guilabel:`Company` fields in the *Details* "
"tab may also be populated, if those details are configured on the job "
"position."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:59
msgid ""
"Complete the fields in the following sections on the new applicant form."
msgstr "Попълнете полетата в следните раздели от новия формуляр за кандидат."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:62
msgid ""
"Depending on installed applications and configurations, some fields may not "
"be displayed."
msgstr ""
"В зависимост от инсталираните приложения и конфигурации, някои полета може "
"да не се показват."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:67
#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:116
msgid "Applicant section"
msgstr "Раздел „Кандидат“"

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:69
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Applicant`: Enter the applicant's name. This field is displayed "
"as the card title in the Kanban view of the *Applications* page. This is the "
"**only** required field on the form."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Кандидат`: Въведете името на кандидата. Това поле се показва като "
"заглавие на картата в изгледа Kanban на страницата *Кандидатури*. Това е "
"**единственото** задължително поле във формуляра."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:71
msgid ":guilabel:`Email`: Enter the applicant's email address."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Имейл`: Въведете имейл адреса на кандидата."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:72
msgid ":guilabel:`Phone`: Enter the applicant's phone number."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Телефон`: Въведете телефонния номер на кандидата."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:73
msgid ""
":guilabel:`LinkedIn Profile`: Enter the web address for the applicant's "
"personal profile on LinkedIn."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Профил в LinkedIn`: Въведете уеб адреса на личния профил на "
"кандидата в LinkedIn."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:75
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Evaluation`: Represents a rating for the applicant: one star "
"(:icon:`fa-star` :icon:`fa-star-o` :icon:`fa-star-o`) is :guilabel:`Good`, "
"two stars (:icon:`fa-star` :icon:`fa-star` :icon:`fa-star-o`) "
"is :guilabel:`Very Good`, and three stars (:icon:`fa-star` :icon:`fa-"
"star` :icon:`fa-star`) is :guilabel:`Excellent`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Оценка`: Представлява оценка за кандидата: една звезда (:icon:`fa-"
"star` :icon:`fa-star-o` :icon:`fa-star-o`) означава :guilabel:`Добър`, две "
"звезди (:icon:`fa-star` :icon:`fa-star` :icon:`fa-star-o`) означава "
":guilabel:`Много добър`, а три звезди (:icon:`fa-star` :icon:`fa-star` "
":icon:`fa-star`) означава :guilabel:`Отличен`."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:79
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Job Position`: Select the job position the applicant is applying "
"for. This field is populated by default but can be changed if necessary."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Длъжност`: Изберете длъжността, за която кандидатства кандидатът. "
"Това поле се попълва автоматично по подразбиране, но може да бъде променено "
"при необходимост."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:81
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Recruiter`: Select the user responsible for the entire "
"recruitment process for the job position. This field is populated by default "
"but can be changed if desired."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Специалист по подбор на персонал`: Изберете потребителя, "
"отговорен за целия процес на подбор за тази длъжност. Това поле се попълва "
"автоматично по подразбиране, но може да бъде променено, ако е необходимо."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:83
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Interviewers`: Using the drop-down menu, select the people to "
"conduct the interviews. The selected people **must** have either *recruiter* "
"or *officer* :doc:`access rights <../../general/users/access_rights>` "
"configured for the **Recruitment** app to appear in the drop-down list."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Интервюиращи`: Чрез падащото меню изберете хората, които ще "
"проведат интервютата. Избраните хора **трябва** да имат конфигурирани "
":doc:`права за достъп <../../general/users/access_rights>` като *специалист "
"по подбор* или *служител*, за да се появят в падащия списък за приложението "
"**Набиране на персонал**."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:87
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Tags`: Select as many tags as desired from the drop-down menu. To "
"add a tag that does not exist, type in the tag name, then "
"click :guilabel:`Create \"new tag\"` from the resulting drop-down menu."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Етикети`: Изберете толкова етикети, колкото желаете, от падащото "
"меню. За да добавите етикет, който не съществува, въведете името на етикета "
"и след това щракнете върху :guilabel:`Създаване на „нов етикет“` в появилото "
"се падащо меню."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:None
msgid ""
"All the fields of the applicant section for a new applicant form entered."
msgstr ""
"Всички полета от раздела за кандидат в новия формуляр за кандидат са "
"попълнени."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:97
msgid ""
"Enter any notes regarding the applicant in this tab. These notes are only "
"visible internally to users who have the proper access rights."
msgstr ""
"Въведете бележки относно кандидата в този раздел. Тези бележки са видими "
"само вътрешно за потребители с подходящи права за достъп."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:101
msgid ""
"A recruiter met an applicant at a job fair and had a discussion regarding "
"the job position as well as the applicant's prior history. They also had a "
"furniture assembly display, with different pieces to be assembled. This "
"allowed the recruiters to view the applicant's skills in real time. The "
"recruiter uses the *Note* tab to enter the following information:"
msgstr ""
"Специалист по подбор на персонал се среща с кандидат на панаир на труда и "
"провежда разговор относно длъжността, както и относно предишния опит на "
"кандидата. Те разполагат и с демонстрация за сглобяване на мебели, с "
"различни части за сглобяване. Това позволява на специалистите по подбор да "
"видят уменията на кандидата в реално време. Специалистът по подбор използва "
"раздела *Бележка*, за да въведе следната информация:"

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:106
msgid ""
"`Met the applicant at a job fair. They have previously worked in furniture "
"assembly for Furniture R Us. They demonstrated their skills at our assembly "
"display, and finished assembling a chair in under 3 minutes - which was the "
"fastest among all participants today.`"
msgstr ""
"`Срещнахме кандидата на панаир на труда. Той/тя е работил(а) преди в "
"сглобяването на мебели за Furniture R Us. Демонстрира уменията си на нашата "
"демонстрация за сглобяване и завърши сглобяването на стол за под 3 минути - "
"което беше най-бързото сред всички участници днес.`"

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:111
#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:58
msgid "Details tab"
msgstr "Раздел „Детайли“"

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:113
msgid ""
"The *Details* tab houses various information regarding the applicant and the "
"job position."
msgstr ""
"Разделът *Детайли* съдържа различна информация относно кандидата и "
"длъжността."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:118
msgid "Enter the following information in the respective fields:"
msgstr "Въведете следната информация в съответните полета:"

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:120
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Degree`: Select the applicant's highest level of education from "
"the drop-down menu. Options are: :guilabel:`Graduate`, :guilabel:`Bachelor "
"Degree`, :guilabel:`Master Degree`, or :guilabel:`Doctoral Degree`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Степен`: Изберете най-високото образователно ниво на кандидата от "
"падащото меню. Опциите са: :guilabel:`Завършено средно образование`, "
":guilabel:`Бакалавърска степен`, :guilabel:`Магистърска степен` или "
":guilabel:`Докторска степен`."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:125
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Graduate` option indicates the applicant graduated at the "
"highest level of school before a Bachelor's degree, such as a high school or "
"secondary school diploma, depending on the country."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:129
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Availability`: Select the available start date for the applicant. "
"To select a date, click on the field to reveal a calendar. Navigate to the "
"date the applicant can start, and click to select it. Leaving this field "
"blank indicates the applicant can start immediately."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:134
#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:88
msgid "Job section"
msgstr "Секция Длъжност"

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:136
msgid ""
"The following fields are preconfigured when creating a new applicant, as "
"long as these fields are specified on the job position form. Editing the "
"fields is possible, if desired."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:139
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Department`: Select the job position's department using the drop-"
"down menu."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:140
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Company`: Select the job position's company using the drop-down "
"menu. This field **only** appears in a multi-company database."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:144
msgid "Salary package section"
msgstr "Секция Пакет за възнаграждение"

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:146
msgid ""
"Configure both the expected and proposed salary and benefits in this "
"section. Fill out the following fields:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:149
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Expected`: Enter the applicant's requested salary amount in this "
"field. The number should be in a `XX,XXX.XX` format. The currency is "
"determined by the localization setting for the company. If any benefits are "
"requested by the applicant, enter them in the blank :guilabel:`Other "
"Benefits` text field next to the :guilabel:`Expected` salary field. The "
"benefits should be short and descriptive, such as `4 Weeks Vacation` or "
"`Dental Plan`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:154
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Proposed`: Enter the salary amount offered to the applicant in "
"this field. The number should be in a `XX,XXX.XX` format. If any benefits "
"are offered to the applicant, enter them in the :guilabel:`Other Benefits` "
"text field next to the :guilabel:`Proposed` field. The benefits should be "
"short and descriptive, such as `Unlimited Sick Time` or `Health Insurance`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:160
msgid "Sourcing section"
msgstr "Секция Източник на кандидата"

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:162
msgid ""
"This section houses the details regarding the way the applicant applied for "
"the job position. This information is necessary for :doc:`employee referrals "
"<../referrals>`, and allows for :doc:`reporting on the channels with the "
"highest applicant generation <source_analysis>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:166
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Referred By User`: If referral points are to be earned for this "
"job position in the **Referrals** application, select the user who referred "
"the applicant from the drop-down menu. The **Referrals** application "
"**must** be installed for this field to appear."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Препоръчан от потребител`: Ако за тази длъжност се печелят точки "
"за препоръка в приложението **Referrals**, изберете от падащото меню "
"потребителя, който е препоръчал кандидата. За да се появи това поле, "
"приложението **Referrals** **трябва** да бъде инсталирано."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:169
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Source`: Using the drop-down menu, select where the applicant "
"learned about the job position. The following options come preconfigured in "
"Odoo: :guilabel:`Search engine`, :guilabel:`Lead "
"Recall`, :guilabel:`Newsletter`, :guilabel:`Facebook`, :guilabel:`X`, :guilabel:`LinkedIn`, :guilabel:`Monster`, :guilabel:`Glassdoor`, :guilabel:`Craigslist`, "
"and :guilabel:`Referral`. To add a new :guilabel:`Source`, type in the "
"source, then click :guilabel:`Create \"(new source)\"`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:175
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Medium`: Using the drop-down menu, specify how the job listing "
"was found. The preconfigured options "
"are: :guilabel:`Banner`, :guilabel:`Direct`, :guilabel:`Email`, :guilabel:`Facebook`, :guilabel:`Google "
"Adwords`, :guilabel:`LinkedIn`, :guilabel:`Phone`, :guilabel:`SMS`, :guilabel:`Television`, :guilabel:`Website`, :guilabel:`X`, "
"or :guilabel:`[Push Notifications] (website name)`. To add a "
"new :guilabel:`Medium`, type in the medium, then click :guilabel:`Create "
"\"(new medium)\"`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:181
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Campaign`: Using the drop-down menu, select the campaign used for "
"the job position."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:None
msgid "All the fields of the Details tab for a new applicant form entered."
msgstr ""
"Всички попълнени полета на раздела Детайли за формуляра на нов кандидат."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:187
msgid "Skills tab"
msgstr "Раздел Умения"

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:189
msgid ""
"The *Skills* tab houses all the applicant's skills. As :ref:`skills are "
"added <employees/skills>`, Odoo compares the :ref:`expected skills "
"<recruitment/new_job/job-posting>` configured for the job position with the "
"applicant's skills."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:193
msgid ""
"Additionally, the :guilabel:`Job Position Matching` scale updates in real "
"time, showing the percentage of the job skills the applicant has. This aids "
"recruiters when assessing an applicant."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:197
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Job Position Matching` scale displays the graphic in purple. "
"If the applicant matches 100% of the required skills, the graphic appears "
"green."
msgstr ""
"Скалата :guilabel:`Съответствие с длъжността` показва графиката в лилаво. "
"Ако кандидатът отговаря на 100% от изискваните умения, графиката се показва "
"в зелено."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/add_applicants.rst:None
msgid "The applicant's skills as compared to the job requirements."
msgstr "Уменията на кандидата, сравнени с изискванията за длъжността."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/application_analysis.rst:3
msgid "Application analysis"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/application_analysis.rst:5
msgid ""
"The *Application Analysis* report allows recruiting departments to see the "
"total number of applications submitted for the past 365 days. Along with the "
"total, the number of hired applicants, refused applicants, and those still "
"in the pipeline are displayed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/application_analysis.rst:9
msgid ""
"This information can help the recruiting team see how the various rates "
"align with their hiring goals and pivot their strategies to acquire more "
"desirable candidates."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/application_analysis.rst:13
msgid "Application Analysis report"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/application_analysis.rst:15
msgid ""
"To view the *Application Analysis* report, navigate "
"to :menuselection:`Recruitment app --> Reporting --> Application Analysis`. "
"This presents a line chart of all applicants for the last 365 days."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/application_analysis.rst:18
msgid ""
"Three separate color-coded metrics are presented: :guilabel:`In Progress` "
"appears in blue, :guilabel:`Hired` appears in red, and :guilabel:`Refused` "
"appears in green."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/application_analysis.rst:21
msgid ""
"Hover the cursor over a month of the chart, and an *Applications* pop-up "
"window appears, displaying the specific numbers for that month."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/application_analysis.rst:None
msgid "The default Application Analysis report."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/application_analysis.rst:30
#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/team_performance.rst:30
msgid "Pivot table view"
msgstr "Изглед на обобщена таблица"

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/application_analysis.rst:32
msgid ""
"For a more detailed view of the information in the *Application Analysis* "
"report, click the :icon:`oi-view-pivot` :guilabel:`(Pivot)` icon in the "
"corner. This displays all the information in a pivot table."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/application_analysis.rst:36
msgid ""
"In this default view, the months are displayed in the rows, with each job "
"position nested beneath them. The columns display the various stages of the "
"recruitment pipeline, further divided by how many applicants were hired, "
"refused, or still in process while in that stage. The displayed information "
"can be modified, if desired."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/application_analysis.rst:None
#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/team_performance.rst:None
msgid "The detailed pivot table view."
msgstr "Подробен изглед на обобщена таблица."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/application_analysis.rst:45
msgid ""
"To only view the total number of applicants in each stage, click :icon:`fa-"
"minus-square-o` :guilabel:`Total` in the top row. All the stages collapse, "
"displaying only the total number of applications that are :guilabel:`In "
"Progress`, :guilabel:`Hired`, and :guilabel:`Refused`, along with the totals "
"for all three in the :guilabel:`Applications` column. These numbers are "
"organized by month, then job position."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/application_analysis.rst:51
msgid ""
"In this example, of the fourteen newly hired employees, "
"the :guilabel:`Furniture Assembler` position had the most new hires, with a "
"total of four."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/application_analysis.rst:0
msgid "The pivot table showing only the totals in the columns."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/application_analysis.rst:58
msgid "Use case: applicants with referrals"
msgstr "Пример за употреба: кандидати с препоръки"

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/application_analysis.rst:60
msgid ""
"To get a better understanding of how effective the company's :doc:`referral "
"program <../referrals>` is, the *Application Analysis* report can be "
"modified to show how many applicants were referred by current employees."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/application_analysis.rst:64
msgid ""
"From the :ref:`pivot table view <recruitment/application_analysis/pivot>` of "
"the *Application Analysis* report, first click "
"the :guilabel:`Measures` :icon:`fa-caret-down` button to reveal a drop-down "
"menu of options."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/application_analysis.rst:68
msgid ""
"Click both :guilabel:`Has Referrer` and :guilabel:`Count` to activate those "
"two measures. Then, "
"click :guilabel:`Applications`, :guilabel:`Hired`, :guilabel:`In Progress`, "
"and :guilabel:`Refused` to deactivate those default measures. Click away "
"from the drop-down window to close it. Then click :icon:`fa-minus-square-"
"o` :guilabel:`Total` above the columns to condense all the displayed values."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/application_analysis.rst:73
msgid ""
"Now, the columns display the number of applicants that came from a referral "
"in the :guilabel:`Has Referrer` column, and the total number of applicants "
"in the :guilabel:`Count` column."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/application_analysis.rst:76
msgid ""
"In this example, the :guilabel:`Furniture Assembler` job position has the "
"most referrals, and almost 25% of all applications were submitted through a "
"referral."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/application_analysis.rst:None
msgid ""
"The detailed pivot table view displaying the number of referrals and the "
"total applicants."
msgstr ""
"Подробен изглед на обобщена таблица, показващ броя на препоръките и общия "
"брой кандидати."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/application_analysis.rst:83
msgid "Hired through referrals"
msgstr "Наети чрез препоръки"

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/application_analysis.rst:85
msgid ""
"It is possible to modify this report even further to see how many referred "
"applicants end up being hired."
msgstr ""
"Възможно е този отчет да бъде допълнително модифициран, за да се види колко "
"от препоръчаните кандидати в крайна сметка биват наети."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/application_analysis.rst:88
msgid ""
"To view this data, click on a :icon:`fa-plus-square` :guilabel:`(job "
"position)` row, which reveals a drop-down menu. Then, "
"click :guilabel:`State` to show the various states applicants are currently "
"in."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/application_analysis.rst:92
msgid ""
"To expand the other rows and display the various states, click on "
"the :icon:`fa-plus-square` :guilabel:`(job position)` button."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/application_analysis.rst:96
msgid ""
"Only states that have applicants in them are shown for each job position. If "
"a state does **not** have any applicants, it does not appear in the list."
msgstr ""
"За всяка длъжност се показват само етапите, в които има кандидати. Ако даден "
"етап **не** има кандидати, той не се появява в списъка."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:3
msgid "Job positions"
msgstr "Длъжности"

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:5
msgid ""
"In Odoo's **Recruitment** application, all job positions are shown on the "
"default *Job Positions* dashboard, which includes both active and inactive "
"positions."
msgstr ""
"В приложението **Recruitment** на Odoo всички длъжности се показват в "
"началното табло *Длъжности*, което включва както активни, така и неактивни "
"позиции."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:8
msgid ""
"Each job position is shown in an individual Kanban card. If the job position "
"is active, and candidates can apply, a green :guilabel:`Published` banner "
"appears in the top-right corner of the card."
msgstr ""
"Всяка длъжност се показва в отделна Kanban карта. Ако длъжността е активна и "
"кандидатите могат да кандидатстват, в горния десен ъгъл на картата се "
"появява зелен банер :guilabel:`Публикувано`."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:12
msgid ""
"View submitted applications by clicking anywhere on a job position card, "
"except the :icon:`fa-clock-o` :guilabel:`(Activities)` icon, "
"the :guilabel:`Job Page` button, or the :guilabel:`Configure` button."
msgstr ""
"За да видите подадените кандидатури, щракнете върху произволно място в "
"картата на длъжността, с изключение на иконата :icon:`fa-clock-o` :guilabel:`"
"(Дейности)`, бутона :guilabel:`Страница за работа` или бутона "
":guilabel:`Конфигуриране`."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:None
msgid "Main dashboard view of Recruitment app showing all job positions."
msgstr ""
"Изглед на основното табло на приложението Recruitment, показващо всички "
"длъжности."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:22
msgid "Create a job position"
msgstr "Създаване на длъжност"

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:24
msgid ""
"To create a job position from the main dashboard in the **Recruitment** app, "
"click the :guilabel:`New` button in the top-left corner, and a *Create a Job "
"Position* pop-up window appears."
msgstr ""
"За да създадете длъжност от основното табло в приложението **Recruitment**, "
"щракнете върху бутона :guilabel:`Ново` в горния ляв ъгъл и се появява "
"изскачащ прозорец *Създаване на длъжност*."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:27
msgid ""
"First, enter the name of the :guilabel:`Job Position` (such as `Sales "
"Manager`, `Mechanical Engineer`, etc.) in the corresponding field."
msgstr ""
"Първо въведете името на :guilabel:`Длъжност` (например `Мениджър продажби`, "
"`Машинен инженер` и т.н.) в съответното поле."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:30
msgid ""
"Next, enter an :guilabel:`Application email` by typing in the first half of "
"the email address in the first field, then select the second half of the "
"email using the drop-down menu in the second field. Applicants can send a "
"resumé to this specific email address, and Odoo creates an application for "
"them automatically."
msgstr ""
"След това въведете :guilabel:`Имейл за кандидатстване`, като напишете "
"първата половина от имейл адреса в първото поле, след което изберете втората "
"половина на имейла от падащото меню във второто поле. Кандидатите могат да "
"изпращат автобиография на този конкретен имейл адрес и Odoo автоматично "
"създава кандидатура за тях."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:35
msgid ""
"When complete, click the :guilabel:`Create` button to save the entry, or "
"the :guilabel:`Discard` button to delete it."
msgstr ""
"Когато приключите, щракнете върху бутона :guilabel:`Създаване`, за да "
"запазите записа, или върху бутона :guilabel:`Отхвърляне`, за да го изтриете."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:None
msgid "Create a new job position."
msgstr "Създаване на нова длъжност."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:42
msgid ""
"Once the :guilabel:`Create` button is clicked, the *Applications* dashboard "
"for the newly created job loads. The *Applications* dashboard is empty, as "
"there are no applicants. Click the :guilabel:`Job Positions` breadcrumb to "
"return to the main **Recruitment** app dashboard."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:49
msgid "Configure a job position"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:51
msgid ""
"Once the job position has been :ref:`created <recruitment/new_job/create-job-"
"position>`, the details must be configured. On the main **Recruitment** app "
"dashboard, click the :guilabel:`Configure` button at the end of the Kanban "
"card, and the detailed job position form loads."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:55
msgid ""
"Configure the *Details*, *Summary*, *Application Info*, and *Trackers* tabs, "
"as described below."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:60
msgid ""
"All the basic details about the job position are housed in the *Details* tab."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:62
msgid ""
"None of the fields are required, but it is important to configure and "
"populate the :guilabel:`Department`, :guilabel:`Job Location`, "
"and :guilabel:`Employment Type` fields, as they are all visible to "
"prospective applicants on the website."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:67
msgid ""
"Some fields listed below may not appear depending on the installed apps and "
"database configuration."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:70
msgid "Enter the information in the following sections."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:75
msgid "Hiring process section"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:77
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Recruiter`: Select the person responsible for recruiting this "
"role."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Рекрутер`: Изберете лицето, отговорно за подбора на персонал за "
"тази роля."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:78
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Interviewers`: Select who should perform the interviews. Multiple "
"people can be selected."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Интервюиращи`: Изберете кой ще провежда интервютата. Може да "
"бъдат избрани няколко души."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:80
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Interview Form`: Select an interview form that applicants fill "
"out prior to their interview."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:82
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Email Alias`: Enter an email address to which applicants can send "
"a resumé. Once emailed, Odoo automatically creates an application for them. "
"If an email was entered when creating the job position, this field is "
"populated."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Имейл псевдоним`: Въведете имейл адрес, на който кандидатите "
"могат да изпращат автобиография. След изпращането на имейла, Odoo "
"автоматично създава кандидатура за тях. Ако при създаването на длъжността е "
"въведен имейл, това поле се попълва автоматично."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:85
msgid ":guilabel:`Website`: Select the website the job is published on."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Уебсайт`: Изберете уебсайта, на който ще бъде публикувана "
"длъжността."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:90
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Company`: Select the company the job is for. This field only "
"appears if using a multi-company database."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Фирма`: Изберете фирмата, за която е длъжността. Това поле се "
"показва само при използване на мултифирмена база данни."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:92
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Department`: Select the relevant department for the job position. "
"This is visible on the website."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Отдел`: Изберете съответния отдел за длъжността. Това е видимо на "
"уебсайта."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:94
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Job Location`: Select the physical address for the job. If the "
"job position is remote, leave this field blank. This is visible on the "
"website."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Месторабота`: Изберете физическия адрес за длъжността. Ако "
"длъжността е дистанционна, оставете това поле празно. Това е видимо на "
"уебсайта."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:100
msgid "Job posting section"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:102
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Published`: When the job position is ready to be published on the "
"website, click the :guilabel:`Published` toggle to publish the job position. "
"The toggle changes to green, indicating the listing is live on the website."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:105
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Target`: Enter the number of employees to be hired for this "
"position."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Цел`: Въведете броя служители, които трябва да бъдат наети за "
"тази длъжност."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:106
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Expected Skills`: Select all the desired skills for the job "
"position in this field. To add a skill, click the :icon:`fa-"
"plus` :guilabel:`(plus sign)` icon, and select the *Category*, *Skill*, and "
"*Skill Level* for each skill added. The skills presented "
"are :ref:`configured in the Employees app <employees/skills>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:110
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Expected Degree`: Select the level of education desired, using "
"the drop-down menu. The default options "
"are: :guilabel:`Graduate`, :guilabel:`Bachelor Degree`, :guilabel:`Master "
"Degree`, and :guilabel:`Doctoral Degree`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:113
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Salary Range`: Enter both the minimum and maximum salaries "
"offered for the position in the two fields. Then, set the last field to the "
"time-frame for the salary range. The default options "
"are :guilabel:`Hour`, :guilabel:`Day`, :guilabel:`Week`, :guilabel:`Bi-"
"Week`, :guilabel:`Month`, and :guilabel:`Year`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Диапазон на заплатата`: Въведете минималната и максималната "
"заплата, предлагани за длъжността, в двете полета. След това задайте в "
"последното поле периода за диапазона на заплатата. Стандартните опции са "
":guilabel:`Час`, :guilabel:`Ден`, :guilabel:`Седмица`, :guilabel:`Две "
"седмици`, :guilabel:`Месец` и :guilabel:`Година`."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:119
msgid "Contract section"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:121
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Employment Type`: Select what type of position the job is, using "
"the drop-down menu. The default options "
"are :guilabel:`Permanent`, :guilabel:`Temporary`, :guilabel:`Interim`, :guilabel:`Seasonal`, :guilabel:`Full-"
"Time`, :guilabel:`Part-"
"Time`, :guilabel:`Intern`, :guilabel:`Student`, :guilabel:`Apprenticeship`, :guilabel:`Thesis`, :guilabel:`Statutory`, "
"and :guilabel:`Employee`. Depending on the installed localization, other "
"options may be available. This is visible on the website."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:127
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Working Schedule`: Select the working schedule for the job "
"position. Odoo provides one working schedule by default, :guilabel:`Standard "
"40 hours/week`, but all working schedules in the database are available."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Работен график`: Изберете работния график за длъжността. По "
"подразбиране Odoo предоставя един работен график, :guilabel:`Стандартно 40 "
"часа/седмица`, но са налични всички работни графици в базата данни."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:130
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Contract Template`: Select a contract template to be used when "
"offering the job to a candidate."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Шаблон на договор`: Изберете шаблон на договор, който да се "
"използва при предлагането на длъжността на кандидат."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:None
msgid "The job information details in the Recruitment tab."
msgstr "Информацията за длъжността в раздела „Подбор на персонал“."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:137
msgid "Summary tab"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:139
msgid ""
"Enter the complete job description in the *Summary* tab. This description is "
"visible on the website, and should convey any relevant information for the "
"position that is **not** covered or explained in the *Details* tab. This may "
"include information such as specific tasks the job requires, any required "
"past experience, or uncommon benefits or compensation."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:None
msgid "The summary of the position in the Job Summary tab."
msgstr "Обобщението на длъжността в раздела „Обобщение на длъжността“."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:150
msgid "Application info tab"
msgstr "Раздел „Информация за кандидатстването“"

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:152
msgid ""
"The *Process Details* section of the *Application Info* tab contains "
"information that is displayed online for the job position. This informs the "
"applicants of the timeline and steps for the recruitment process, so they "
"know when to expect a reply."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:156
msgid ""
"The following fields are populated by default, but can be modified to suit "
"the recruitment timeline of the business:"
msgstr ""
"Следните полета се попълват по подразбиране, но могат да бъдат променени, за "
"да съответстват на времевата рамка за подбор на персонал на бизнеса:"

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:159
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Time to Answer`: The number of days before the applicant is "
"contacted. :guilabel:`2 open days` populates this field by default."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:161
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Process`: The various stages the candidate goes through during "
"the recruitment process. By default, two process steps are "
"visible: :guilabel:`1 Phone Call` and :guilabel:`1 Onsite Interview`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:164
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Days to get an Offer`: The number of days before the applicant "
"should expect an offer after the recruitment process has ended. The default "
"is :guilabel:`4 Days after Interview`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:None
msgid "Enter job information details in the recruitment tab."
msgstr "Въведете информацията за длъжността в раздела „Подбор на персонал“."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:171
msgid ""
"The *Process Details* section of the *Application Info* tab is a text field. "
"All answers are typed in rather than selected from a drop-down menu. The "
"text is displayed on the website exactly as it appears in this tab."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:176
msgid "Trackers tab"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:178
msgid ""
"When reaching potential applicants, recruiters often share the job position "
"across multiple websites, including social media sites, job board sites, and "
"third-party hosting sites. The *Trackers* tab provides a centralized place "
"for recruiters to keep a record of all the places a tracking link has been "
"shared. This allows recruiters to determine which sites were the most "
"successful in terms of receiving applications from them."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:185
msgid ""
"Before creating trackers, first :ref:`publish <recruitment/post-job/"
"website>` the job on the company website."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:188
msgid ""
"To add a tracking link, click on the *Trackers* tab, click :guilabel:`Add a "
"line`, and a blank line appears at the top of the list. Configure the "
"following fields for each tracker:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:191
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Campaign`: Select the :ref:`campaign <marketing/social-campaigns/"
"new-campaign>` the job position falls under using the drop-down menu."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:193
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Source`: Select where the tracker was used using the drop-down "
"menu. There are ten default options, such as :guilabel:`Search "
"engine`, :guilabel:`Newsletter`, and :guilabel:`LinkedIn`, but more may be "
"available depending on the installed applications and created events."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:197
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Medium`: Select the method used to share the tracker from a list "
"of ten default options, such as :guilabel:`Banner`, :guilabel:`Email`, "
"and :guilabel:`Google Adwords`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:199
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Tracker URL`: Once the :guilabel:`Campaign`, :guilabel:`Source`, "
"and :guilabel:`Medium` are defined, Odoo automatically creates the "
"corresponding tracking link. Click :guilabel:`URL` :icon:`fa-clipboard` to "
"copy the link to the clipboard, then share the link where appropriate."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:202
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Email`: Once the :guilabel:`Campaign`, :guilabel:`Source`, "
"and :guilabel:`Medium` are defined, Odoo automatically creates the "
"corresponding email. Click :guilabel:`Email` :icon:`fa-clipboard` to copy "
"the email address to the clipboard, then share the email where appropriate."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:None
msgid "The list of all tracked links for the job position."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:211
msgid "Job boards tab"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:213
msgid ""
"The *Job Boards* tab is automatically populated as the job position "
"is :ref:`shared on a job board <recruitment/post-job/boards>`. As each "
"listing is created, the information appears in this tab."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/new_job.rst:217
msgid ":doc:`post_job`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/offer_job_positions.rst:3
msgid "Offer job positions"
msgstr "Предлагане на длъжности"

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/offer_job_positions.rst:5
msgid ""
"After an applicant has successfully passed the various interview stages, the "
"recruitment team is ready to send an offer for employment. The first step in "
"this process is to :ref:`send the applicant a contract <recruitment/"
"offer_job_positions/contract-proposal>`. Once the contract is :ref:`fully "
"signed <recruitment/offer_job_positions/contract-signed>`, the :ref:`new "
"employee record is created <recruitment/offer_job_positions/new-employee>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/offer_job_positions.rst:12
msgid ""
"The *Salary Configurator* module **must** be :ref:`installed <general/"
"install>` to send an offer using the :guilabel:`Generate Offer` button."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/offer_job_positions.rst:18
#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/recruitment_flow.rst:190
msgid "Contract proposal"
msgstr "Предложение за договор"

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/offer_job_positions.rst:20
msgid ""
"When an offer is ready to be sent, first move the applicant to "
"the :guilabel:`Contract Proposal` stage."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/offer_job_positions.rst:23
msgid ""
"Navigate to the **Recruitment** app, click on the job position Kanban card, "
"then click the desired applicant card. Click the :guilabel:`Contract "
"Proposal` stage in the status bar at the top of the applicant's record."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/offer_job_positions.rst:27
msgid ""
"Next, send an offer to the applicant by clicking the :guilabel:`Generate "
"Offer` button. This loads the *Offer for (applicant)* page."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/offer_job_positions.rst:30
msgid ""
"Most fields are pre-populated with information from the job position. Update "
"or add any relevant information in the corresponding fields."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/offer_job_positions.rst:34
msgid ""
"Depending on the localization setting for the company and which applications "
"are installed, some fields may differ or not appear on the *Offer for "
"(applicant)* page."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/offer_job_positions.rst:38
msgid "Contract fields"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/offer_job_positions.rst:40
msgid ""
"The following fields appear in the *Offer for (applicant)* page regardless "
"of the localization."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/offer_job_positions.rst:42
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Title`: The name for the contract appears in a default `Offer for "
"(applicant)` format."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/offer_job_positions.rst:43
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Contract Template`: The template currently being used to populate "
"the *Offer for (applicant)* page. Use the drop-down menu to select a "
"different :guilabel:`Contract Template`, if desired."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/offer_job_positions.rst:48
msgid ""
"To modify the template, hover over the current template name, click "
"the :icon:`fa-arrow-right` :guilabel:`(Internal link)` icon that appears to "
"the right of the field, and make any desired changes."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/offer_job_positions.rst:52
msgid ""
":guilabel:`PDF Template`: The PDF document the applicant must sign to accept "
"the offer."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/offer_job_positions.rst:53
msgid ":guilabel:`Salary`: The salary being offered to the applicant."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/offer_job_positions.rst:54
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Job Title`: The selected :guilabel:`Employee Job` populates this "
"field by default. The title can be modified to suit the specific applicant's "
"position and provide more details."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/offer_job_positions.rst:58
msgid ""
"An applicant is offered a marketing manager job at a shoe company, "
"specifically for the children's line."
msgstr ""
"На кандидат се предлага длъжност маркетинг мениджър в компания за обувки, "
"специално за детската линия."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/offer_job_positions.rst:61
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Employee Job` selected from the drop-down menu is `Marketing "
"Manager`, and the :guilabel:`Job Title` is modified for their specific "
"responsibilities, `Marketing Manager: Children's Shoes`."
msgstr ""
"Избраната от падащото меню :guilabel:`Длъжност на служителя` е `Маркетинг "
"мениджър`, а :guilabel:`Заглавие на длъжността` е променено според "
"конкретните им отговорности — `Маркетинг мениджър: детски обувки`."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/offer_job_positions.rst:65
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Employee Job`: The name of the :guilabel:`Job Title` being "
"offered to the applicant. The selections available in the drop-down menu "
"correspond to the configured :doc:`job positions <new_job>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/offer_job_positions.rst:68
msgid ":guilabel:`Department`: The department the job position falls under."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Отдел`: Отделът, към който принадлежи длъжността."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/offer_job_positions.rst:69
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Contract Date`: The date the proposed contract takes effect. The "
"default date is the current date. To modify the date, click on the displayed "
"date to reveal a calendar popover window. Navigate to the desired month, "
"then click the day to select it. If the contract has a specific end date, "
"enter the end date in the second field, next to the :icon:`fa-arrow-right` "
"icon."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/offer_job_positions.rst:73
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Offer Create Date`: The day the offer is created. The current "
"date populates this field by default and **cannot** be modified."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/offer_job_positions.rst:75
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Offer Expiration`: The last day the offer is valid. After this "
"date the contract cannot be signed. Click into the field to reveal a "
"calendar popover window. Navigate to the desired date, and click on it to "
"select it."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/offer_job_positions.rst:78
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Applicant`: The name of the applicant appears in this field and "
"**cannot** be modified. Click the name to view the detailed applicant form."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/offer_job_positions.rst:80
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Company`: The name of the company offering the job position "
"appears in this field and **cannot** be modified. This only appears in a "
"multi-company database."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/offer_job_positions.rst:82
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Salary Simulation Preview`: The various costs for the contract "
"appear in this box, including the :guilabel:`Gross`, :guilabel:`Net`, "
"and :guilabel:`Benefits`, along with the total :guilabel:`Company Cost`. "
"These numbers are estimates and should be used for reference only."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/offer_job_positions.rst:None
msgid "A contract with all the fields entered for a sales associate position."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/offer_job_positions.rst:90
msgid "Send offer"
msgstr "Изпращане на оферта"

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/offer_job_positions.rst:92
msgid ""
"Once all desired modifications have been made to the *Offer for (applicant)* "
"page, click the :guilabel:`Send By Email` button to reveal an email pop-up "
"window."
msgstr ""
"След като всички желани промени на страницата *Оферта за (кандидат)* са "
"направени, натиснете бутона :guilabel:`Изпращане по имейл`, за да се отвори "
"изскачащ прозорец за имейл."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/offer_job_positions.rst:95
msgid ""
"The default `Recruitment: Your Salary Package` email template is used, and "
"the :guilabel:`To`, :guilabel:`Subject`, and email body are pre-populated "
"based on the email template."
msgstr ""
"Използва се шаблонът за имейл по подразбиране „Recruitment: Your Salary "
"Package“, а полетата :guilabel:`До`, :guilabel:`Тема` и текстът на имейла се "
"попълват автоматично според шаблона за имейл."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/offer_job_positions.rst:98
msgid ""
"If any attachments need to be added, click the :icon:`fa-"
"paperclip` :guilabel:`(Add Attachment)` button, and a file explorer window "
"appears. Navigate to the desired file, then click :guilabel:`Open` to attach "
"it to the email. The attachment loads and is listed at the bottom of the "
"email body."
msgstr ""
"Ако трябва да се добавят прикачени файлове, натиснете бутона :icon:`fa-"
"paperclip` :guilabel:`(Добавяне на прикачен файл)` и се появява прозорец на "
"файловия мениджър. Отидете до желания файл, след което натиснете "
":guilabel:`Отваряне`, за да го прикачите към имейла. Прикаченият файл се "
"зарежда и се показва в долната част на текста на имейла."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/offer_job_positions.rst:103
msgid ""
"Once the email is ready, click :guilabel:`Send`, and then the email pop-up "
"window closes. Return to the applicant's card, and an :icon:`fa-handshake-"
"o` :guilabel:`Offers` smart button appears at the top."
msgstr ""
"Когато имейлът е готов, натиснете :guilabel:`Изпращане` и изскачащият "
"прозорец за имейл се затваря. Върнете се на картата на кандидата, където в "
"горната част се появява интелигентен бутон :icon:`fa-handshake-o` "
":guilabel:`Оферти`."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/offer_job_positions.rst:108
msgid ""
"The **Sign** application must be installed for the applicant to digitally "
"sign the contract in Odoo. The applicant does **not** need any software "
"installed to sign the offer."
msgstr ""
"Приложението **Подпис** трябва да е инсталирано, за да може кандидатът да "
"подпише договора цифрово в Odoo. Кандидатът **не** се нуждае от инсталиран "
"софтуер, за да подпише офертата."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/offer_job_positions.rst:None
msgid "Send an email to the applicant with a link to the offered salary."
msgstr "Изпратете имейл до кандидата с връзка към предложеното възнаграждение."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/offer_job_positions.rst:117
msgid "Configure your package"
msgstr "Конфигуриране на пакета"

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/offer_job_positions.rst:119
msgid ""
"If applicable, the applicant can modify their salary package. This option is "
"not available for all localizations. Depending on where the company is "
"located, this option may not be available."
msgstr ""
"Ако е приложимо, кандидатът може да промени пакета си от възнаграждение. "
"Тази опция не е налична за всички локализации. В зависимост от "
"местоположението на компанията, тя може да не е налична."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/offer_job_positions.rst:122
msgid ""
"The email template includes a :guilabel:`Configure your package` button. "
"This link takes the applicant to a webpage where they can modify the "
"proposed salary package."
msgstr ""
"Шаблонът за имейл включва бутон :guilabel:`Конфигуриране на пакета`. Тази "
"връзка отвежда кандидата към уебстраница, където може да промени предложения "
"пакет от възнаграждение."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/offer_job_positions.rst:126
msgid "Applicant signature"
msgstr "Подпис на кандидата"

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/offer_job_positions.rst:128
msgid ""
"On the offer page, which is linked in the offer email, the applicant enters "
"their contact information along with any personal information requested on "
"the form. The information entered is transferred to the employee's record "
"once created."
msgstr ""
"На страницата с офертата, свързана в имейла с офертата, кандидатът въвежда "
"своята информация за контакт, заедно с всяка лична информация, поискана във "
"формуляра. Въведената информация се прехвърля в досието на служителя, след "
"като то бъде създадено."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/offer_job_positions.rst:132
msgid ""
"The applicant clicks the :guilabel:`Review Contract & Sign` button to accept "
"the offer, and the contract loads. Click :guilabel:`Click to start` to begin "
"signing the document. All fields are populated according to the applicant's "
"information, but can be modified if necessary."
msgstr ""
"Кандидатът натиска бутона :guilabel:`Преглед на договора и подписване`, за "
"да приеме офертата, и договорът се зарежда. Натиснете :guilabel:`Натиснете, "
"за да започнете`, за да започнете подписването на документа. Всички полета "
"се попълват според информацията на кандидата, но могат да бъдат променени "
"при необходимост."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/offer_job_positions.rst:136
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Next` to navigate to the subsequent fields of the contract. "
"Once all fields are configured, click :guilabel:`Sign it`, and an *Adopt "
"Your Signature* pop-up window loads. Modify the default signature if "
"desired, then click :guilabel:`Sign all` to apply the signature. "
"Click :guilabel:`Next` once more to enter the :guilabel:`Date` in the "
"corresponding field. When done, click the :guilabel:`Validate & Send "
"Completed Document` button, and the contract is signed."
msgstr ""
"Натиснете :guilabel:`Напред`, за да преминете към следващите полета на "
"договора. След като всички полета са попълнени, натиснете "
":guilabel:`Подпишете го` и се зарежда изскачащ прозорец *Приемете своя "
"подпис*. Променете подписа по подразбиране, ако желаете, след което "
"натиснете :guilabel:`Подписване на всички`, за да приложите подписа. "
"Натиснете отново :guilabel:`Напред`, за да въведете :guilabel:`Дата` в "
"съответното поле. Когато сте готови, натиснете бутона "
":guilabel:`Потвърждаване и изпращане на завършения документ` и договорът е "
"подписан."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/offer_job_positions.rst:143
msgid "Management signatures"
msgstr "Подписи на ръководството"

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/offer_job_positions.rst:145
msgid ""
"Once the applicant has signed the contract, the next step is for the person "
"responsible within the company (the :guilabel:`HR Responsible`) must then "
"sign the contract."
msgstr ""
"След като кандидатът подпише договора, следващата стъпка е отговорното лице "
"в компанията (посочено като :guilabel:`Отговорник по човешки ресурси`) също "
"да подпише договора."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/offer_job_positions.rst:148
msgid ""
"The person responsible for signing the contract receives an activity alert "
"that their signature is requested of them in the **Sign** app."
msgstr ""
"Лицето, отговорно за подписването на договора, получава сигнал за дейност, "
"че се изисква неговият подпис в приложението **Подпис**."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/offer_job_positions.rst:154
#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/recruitment_flow.rst:200
msgid "Contract signed"
msgstr "Договорът е подписан"

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/offer_job_positions.rst:156
msgid ""
"Once all parties have fully signed the contract, the applicant is "
"automatically moved to the :guilabel:`Contract Signed` stage, and a "
"green :guilabel:`Hired` banner appears in the corner of both the applicant's "
"card and form."
msgstr ""
"След като всички страни напълно подпишат договора, кандидатът автоматично се "
"премества в етап :guilabel:`Договорът е подписан` и в ъгъла на картата и "
"формуляра на кандидата се появява зелен банер :guilabel:`Нает`."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/offer_job_positions.rst:None
msgid "Hired banner in the corner of applicant card."
msgstr "Банер „Нает“ в ъгъла на картата на кандидата."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/offer_job_positions.rst:166
msgid "Create employee"
msgstr "Създаване на служител"

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/offer_job_positions.rst:168
msgid ""
"Once the applicant has been hired, the next step is to create their employee "
"record. Click the :guilabel:`Create Employee` button in the corner of the "
"hired applicant's form."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/offer_job_positions.rst:171
msgid ""
"An employee form loads with information pulled from the applicant's card and "
"the employee contract."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/offer_job_positions.rst:173
msgid ""
"Fill out the rest of the employee form. For detailed information on the "
"fields, refer to the :doc:`../employees/new_employee` documentation."
msgstr ""
"Попълнете останалата част от формуляра на служителя. За подробна информация "
"относно полетата, вижте документацията :doc:`../employees/new_employee`."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/offer_job_positions.rst:176
msgid "Once completed, the employee record is saved in the **Employees** app."
msgstr ""
"След приключване записът на служителя се запазва в приложението "
"**Employees**."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/post_job.rst:3
msgid "Post job positions"
msgstr "Публикуване на длъжности"

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/post_job.rst:5
msgid ""
"After a job position has been :doc:`created and configured <new_job>`, the "
"next step is to share it so that prospective applicants can apply."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/post_job.rst:8
msgid ""
"Job positions can be shared on the :ref:`company website <recruitment/post-"
"job/website>` or on :ref:`job boards <recruitment/post-job/boards>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/post_job.rst:14
msgid "Publish to website"
msgstr "Публикуване в уебсайта"

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/post_job.rst:16
msgid ""
"To publish a job listing on the company's website, first a setting must be "
"enabled in the **Recruitment** app. Navigate to :menuselection:`Recruitment "
"app --> Configuration --> Settings`, and enable the :guilabel:`Online "
"Posting` option. Click the :guilabel:`Save` button after making any changes."
msgstr ""
"За да публикувате обява за работа на уебсайта на фирмата, първо трябва да "
"активирате настройка в приложението **Recruitment**. Отидете на "
":menuselection:`приложение Recruitment --> Конфигурация --> Настройки` и "
"активирайте опцията :guilabel:`Онлайн публикуване`. Кликнете върху бутона "
":guilabel:`Запазване` след като направите промените."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/post_job.rst:22
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Online Posting` option is only available if the :doc:`Website "
"<../../websites/website>` application is also installed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/post_job.rst:25
msgid ""
"Once the setting has been enabled, open the main **Recruitment** dashboard "
"by navigating to :menuselection:`Recruitment app --> Applications --> By Job "
"Positions`. Next, click the :guilabel:`Job Page` button, then click "
"the :guilabel:`Unpublished` toggle in the upper-right corner. The toggle "
"becomes green and displays :guilabel:`Published`. Return to the main "
"dashboard by navigating to :menuselection:`Recruitment app --> Applications "
"--> By Job Positions`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/post_job.rst:31
msgid ""
"When a job position is published, a green :guilabel:`Published` banner "
"appears in the top-right corner of the job position card."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/post_job.rst:35
msgid ""
"Alternatively, click the :guilabel:`Configure` button on a job position "
"card, then click the :guilabel:`Published` toggle in the *Job Posting* "
"section of the *Details* tab."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/post_job.rst:41
msgid "Post on job boards"
msgstr "Публикуване в сайтове за обяви за работа"

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/post_job.rst:43
msgid ""
"Posting a job on a job board is an effective way to reach a wider audience "
"and attract more candidates."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/post_job.rst:47
msgid ""
"Currently, Odoo only supports directly posting to Monster.com. Check back "
"frequently for more updates, as more job boards are added."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/post_job.rst:51
msgid "Job board credentials"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/post_job.rst:53
msgid ""
"To publish a job listing onto a job board outside of Odoo, the job board "
"credentials must be configured first. Navigate "
"to :menuselection:`Recruitment app --> Configuration --> Settings`. In the "
"*Monster Credentials* section, enter the :guilabel:`Username` "
"and :guilabel:`Password` for Monster in the corresponding fields, then click "
"the :guilabel:`Save` button."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/post_job.rst:59
msgid ""
"When installing the **Recruitment** app, the following modules are "
"automatically installed: *Job Board - Monster.com*, *Job Board - Monster.com "
"(Skills)*, and *Job Board - Monster.com (Website)*. If any of these modules "
"are *not* installed, :doc:`install them <../../general/apps_modules>` from "
"the main **Apps** app."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/post_job.rst:65
msgid "Publish on job board"
msgstr "Публикуване в сайт за обяви за работа"

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/post_job.rst:67
msgid ""
"Once the credentials have been configured for the job board, it is possible "
"to post a job position."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/post_job.rst:69
msgid ""
"Navigate to :menuselection:`Recruitment app --> Applications --> Job Boards "
"Posts`, click :guilabel:`Publish on Jobs Board`, and a *Publish on a Job "
"Board* pop-up window loads. Fill out the following information in the pop-up "
"window:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/post_job.rst:73
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Job`: Select the job position being shared using the drop-down "
"menu."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/post_job.rst:74
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Industry`: Select the relevant industry the job position falls "
"under with the drop-down menu. This field corresponds to industries on the "
"job board, and can aid applicants searching for positions within a specific "
"industry."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/post_job.rst:77
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Job Board`: Select the job board being posted to with the drop-"
"down menu."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/post_job.rst:78
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Apply Method`: Click the desired radio button to determine how "
"applicants apply for the position. The two options are:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/post_job.rst:81
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Send an Email`: Select this for applicants to apply for the job "
"via email."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Изпращане на имейл`: Изберете тази опция, за да могат кандидатите "
"да кандидатстват за длъжността по имейл."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/post_job.rst:82
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Redirect to company's website`: Select this for applicants to "
"apply for the job via the company website."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Пренасочване към уебсайта на фирмата`: Изберете тази опция, за да "
"могат кандидатите да кандидатстват за длъжността чрез уебсайта на фирмата."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/post_job.rst:85
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Email` or :guilabel:`Job url`: The selected :guilabel:`Apply "
"Method` determines which field appears. The field is populated with the "
"information from the job card, if available. Make any desired modifications "
"to this field, for example, enter a tracking URL for the job board listing."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/post_job.rst:89
msgid ""
":guilabel:`From` and :guilabel:`to`: Using the calendar selector, select the "
"date the job is posted to the job board in the :guilabel:`From` field. "
"The :guilabel:`to` field says :guilabel:`No Limit` by default. If the job "
"position should be removed from the job board on a specific date, enter it "
"in the second field."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/post_job.rst:93
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Mission Dates`: If there is a set start date for the job "
"position, select the date using the calendar selector. When configured, if "
"the applicant is hired for the job position, their availability on the job "
"board is updated to reflect they are no longer available."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/post_job.rst:96
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Description` tab: The description from the job card populates "
"this tab by default. Make any desired changes to it in this section. This is "
"what appears on the job board."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/post_job.rst:100
msgid ""
"Click the :guilabel:`Generate Description` (:icon:`fa-magic` :guilabel:`AI`) "
"to use AI to edit or create the job description."
msgstr ""
"Кликнете върху :guilabel:`Генериране на описание` (:icon:`fa-magic` "
":guilabel:`AI`), за да използвате AI за редактиране или създаване на "
"описанието на длъжността."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/post_job.rst:103
msgid ""
"Once the listing is ready, click the :guilabel:`Post` button. After the post "
"has been published to a job board, the *Job Boards Posts* page reloads, and "
"the new post appears in a Kanban card."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/post_job.rst:None
msgid "A job board listing form filled out."
msgstr "Попълнен формуляр за обява в сайт за обяви за работа."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/post_job.rst:110
msgid "Job board emails"
msgstr "Имейли на сайтове за обяви за работа"

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/post_job.rst:112
msgid ""
"When posting job positions on a job board, like Indeed or LinkedIn, the job "
"board posts the job position, and typically allows the website visitor to "
"apply to the job directly from the job board."
msgstr ""
"Когато публикувате длъжности в сайт за обяви за работа, като Indeed или "
"LinkedIn, сайтът публикува длъжността и обикновено позволява на посетителя "
"на уебсайта да кандидатства директно от него."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/post_job.rst:115
msgid ""
"When someone applies to a job directly from a job board, an email is sent to "
"Odoo from a specific email address, such as `jobs-listings@linkedin.com`. "
"The email uses regular expression (regex) rules, which are instructions to "
"match text in the email and map it to specific fields in Odoo."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/post_job.rst:119
msgid ""
"When Odoo receives an email from the job board's corresponding email "
"address, it runs the regex rule and pulls applicant information from the "
"email when creating an applicant record."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/post_job.rst:123
msgid ""
"The regex rule for :guilabel:`LinkedIn` (emails received from: `jobs-"
"listings@linkedin.com`) is :guilabel:`New application:.*from (.*)`. This "
"rule tells Odoo to capture everything after the word `from` when creating "
"the applicant record."
msgstr ""
"Правилото на regex за :guilabel:`LinkedIn` (имейли, получени от: `jobs-"
"listings@linkedin.com`) е :guilabel:`New application:.*from (.*)`. Това "
"правило указва на Odoo да прихване всичко след думата `from`, когато създава "
"записа за кандидата."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/post_job.rst:127
msgid ""
"An email subject of `New application: Job ID 123 from John Doe` will capture "
"`John Doe` and create an applicant record for `John Doe`."
msgstr ""
"Тема на имейл `New application: Job ID 123 from John Doe` ще прихване `John "
"Doe` и ще създаде запис за кандидат за `John Doe`."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/post_job.rst:130
msgid ""
"To view the currently configured job board emails, navigate "
"to :menuselection:`Recruitment app --> Configuration --> Emails`. Three "
"emails come preconfigured in the "
"database: :guilabel:`LinkedIn`, :guilabel:`Jobsdb`, and :guilabel:`Indeed`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/post_job.rst:135
msgid "Create job board emails"
msgstr "Създаване на имейли на сайтове за обяви за работа"

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/post_job.rst:137
msgid ""
"To create a new job board email, navigate to :menuselection:`Recruitment app "
"--> Configuration --> Emails`. Click the :guilabel:`New` button, and a blank "
"*Emails* form loads."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/post_job.rst:140
msgid ""
"Enter the :guilabel:`Name` for the platform, such as `Glassdoor`, in the "
"corresponding field. Next, enter the email address the applications come "
"from in the :guilabel:`Email` field. Last, enter the :guilabel:`regex` rules "
"in the corresponding field."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/post_job.rst:145
msgid "View job board listings"
msgstr "Преглед на обявите в сайтове за обяви за работа"

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/post_job.rst:147
msgid ""
"To view all the job positions that have been posted to a job board, navigate "
"to :menuselection:`Recruitment --> Applications --> Job Boards Posts`. This "
"presents the :guilabel:`Job Boards Posts` dashboard and all job board "
"postings."
msgstr ""
"За да видите всички длъжности, публикувани в сайт за обяви за работа, "
"отидете на :menuselection:`Recruitment --> Кандидатури --> Job Boards "
"Posts`. Това показва таблото :guilabel:`Job Boards Posts` и всички "
"публикации в сайтове за обяви за работа."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/post_job.rst:151
msgid ""
"Each listing is displayed in an individual Kanban card, with the following "
"information:"
msgstr "Всяка обява се показва в отделна канбан карта със следната информация:"

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/post_job.rst:153
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Job Board Icon`: The icon for the job board where the listing is "
"posted."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/post_job.rst:154
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Job Board Listing Title`: The job position title and job board "
"name."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/post_job.rst:155
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Status Dot`: The status of the post. A green dot indicates the "
"post is live, a blue dot indicates it is scheduled to be published in the "
"future, and a red dot indicates there is an issue with the post and the "
"posting failed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/post_job.rst:158
msgid ":guilabel:`From`: The date the listing was published."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/post_job.rst:159
msgid ":guilabel:`To`: The date the listing is removed from the job board."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/post_job.rst:160
msgid ":guilabel:`User Icon`: The icon of the user who posted the listing."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/post_job.rst:162
msgid ""
"Click on any Kanban card to view the details for the specific job board "
"listing."
msgstr ""
"Кликнете върху която и да е канбан карта, за да видите подробностите за "
"конкретната обява в сайта за обяви за работа."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/post_job.rst:None
msgid "All job positions posted to a job board."
msgstr "Всички длъжности, публикувани в сайт за обяви за работа."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/recruitment_flow.rst:3
msgid "Recruitment flow"
msgstr "Процес на подбор на персонал"

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/recruitment_flow.rst:5
msgid ""
"When a prospective employee applies for a job in Odoo, there is a "
"preconfigured process from the :ref:`initial inquiry <recruitment/"
"recruitment_flow/new>` to the :ref:`creation of a new employee <recruitment/"
"offer_job_positions/new-employee>` once hired. The following outlines the "
"default recruitment process for Odoo's **Recruitment** application."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/recruitment_flow.rst:11
msgid ""
"The following is based on Odoo's *default* recruitment pipeline. Be advised "
"that if :ref:`modifications are made <recruitment/customize-stages>` to the "
"pipeline, the process differs."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/recruitment_flow.rst:20
msgid ""
"At the start of the process, all applicants appear in the :guilabel:`New` "
"stage on the *Applications* page, whether they submitted through the company "
"website, emailed a resumé to the email alias, or were :doc:`manually added "
"by a recruiter <add_applicants>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/recruitment_flow.rst:24
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Applicant`, :guilabel:`Email`, and :guilabel:`Phone` number "
"on the applicant's card are filled as soon as it is created. By default, "
"these details are required for every job position."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/recruitment_flow.rst:28
msgid ""
"If the website application form is modified, different fields may be "
"populated, based on what information is required on the website."
msgstr ""
"Ако формулярът за кандидатстване на уебсайта бъде променен, могат да се "
"попълват различни полета, в зависимост от това каква информация се изисква "
"на уебсайта."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/recruitment_flow.rst:31
msgid ""
"Anything typed in the *Short Introduction* section appears in the "
"applicant's chatter as a note from :guilabel:`OdooBot`, labeled *Other "
"Information*."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/recruitment_flow.rst:37
msgid ""
"If a resumé was attached to the online application, it appears in the "
"*Files* section of the chatter, and is also stored in the **Documents** "
"application."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/recruitment_flow.rst:40
msgid ""
"To find the recruitment documents, navigate to the "
"main :menuselection:`Documents` app dashboard, and click "
"the :guilabel:`Recruitment` folder on the side. All recruitment documents "
"are stored within that folder."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/recruitment_flow.rst:45
msgid ""
"Depending on the browser zoom level, or size of the browser screen, the "
"resumé may appear below the main applicant card information as a PDF link, "
"or on the right side as an image."
msgstr ""
"В зависимост от нивото на увеличение на браузъра или размера на екрана на "
"браузъра, автобиографията може да се показва под основната информация в "
"картата на кандидата като PDF връзка, или от дясната страна като изображение."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/recruitment_flow.rst:49
msgid "Send interview"
msgstr "Изпращане на интервю"

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/recruitment_flow.rst:51
msgid ""
"At any point in the hiring process, an interview can be sent to the "
"applicant to obtain more information. These interviews are custom-made, and "
"can be formatted in a variety of ways."
msgstr ""
"На всеки етап от процеса по наемане може да се изпрати интервю до кандидата, "
"за да се получи повече информация. Тези интервюта се изготвят по поръчка и "
"могат да бъдат форматирани по различни начини."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/recruitment_flow.rst:54
msgid ""
"The **Surveys** application is required to send interviews to an applicant, "
"so it **must** be installed."
msgstr ""
"Приложението **Surveys** е необходимо за изпращане на интервюта до кандидат, "
"така че то **трябва** да бъде инсталирано."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/recruitment_flow.rst:57
msgid ""
"Odoo uses the term *interview*, but these can be thought of as "
"questionnaires, surveys, tests, certifications, etc. :doc:`Custom interviews "
"<new_job>` can be formatted to suit each individual job position's needs."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/recruitment_flow.rst:62
msgid ""
"A job position for a computer programmer could have an interview in the form "
"of a programming quiz to determine the skill level of the applicant. A job "
"position for a restaurant server could have a questionnaire inquiring about "
"the applicant's availability, if the desired applicant needs to be available "
"on weekend evenings."
msgstr ""
"Длъжност за компютърен програмист може да има интервю под формата на тест по "
"програмиране, за да се определи нивото на умения на кандидата. Длъжност за "
"сервитьор в ресторант може да има въпросник, който да проучва наличността на "
"кандидата, ако желаният кандидат трябва да бъде на разположение в почивните "
"дни вечер."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/recruitment_flow.rst:67
msgid ""
"To send an interview to an applicant, first open the applicant's card from "
"the *Applications* page to view the detailed applicant information. In the "
"top corner of the applicant's card, click the :guilabel:`Send Interview` "
"button."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/recruitment_flow.rst:71
msgid ""
"If the applicant's card has an email address on file, a *Send an interview* "
"pop-up window appears, with the :guilabel:`Recipients`, :guilabel:`Subject`, "
"and email body populated."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/recruitment_flow.rst:75
msgid ""
"To send an email to an applicant, there **must** be an :guilabel:`Email` "
"address on the applicant's card."
msgstr ""
"За да изпратите имейл на кандидат, в картата на кандидата **трябва** да има "
"адрес :guilabel:`Имейл`."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/recruitment_flow.rst:78
msgid ""
"If an email address is missing on the applicant's card, when "
"the :guilabel:`Send Interview` button is clicked and the *Send an interview* "
"pop-up window loads, a second pop-up window appears under "
"the :guilabel:`Recipients` field. This pop-up window displays `What's the "
"email address of (applicant name)?` along with a field to enter the email "
"address. Once entered, click :guilabel:`Set Email`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/recruitment_flow.rst:84
msgid ""
"The email address entered is only used to send the interview, and does "
"**not** appear on the applicant's card."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/recruitment_flow.rst:87
msgid ""
"Sometimes, preconfigured :doc:`email templates <../../general/companies/"
"email_template>` in Odoo use dynamic placeholders, which are automatically "
"filled with specific data when the email is sent. For example, if a "
"placeholder for the applicant's name is used, it is replaced with the actual "
"name of the applicant in the email."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/recruitment_flow.rst:92
msgid ""
"Add the email addresses of any additional recipients for the survey in "
"the :guilabel:`Additional emails` field, if more people should receive the "
"email. If an email address is in the database as a contact, add that contact "
"in the :guilabel:`Recipients` field. If an email should be sent to someone "
"who is *not* in the database, and they should *not* be added as a contact, "
"add their email address in the :guilabel:`Additional emails` field."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/recruitment_flow.rst:98
msgid ""
"If any attachments need to be added, click the :icon:`fa-"
"paperclip` :guilabel:`Attachments` button, and a file explorer window "
"appears. Navigate to the desired file, and click :guilabel:`Open` to attach "
"it to the email. The attachment loads, and is listed above the :icon:`fa-"
"paperclip` :guilabel:`Attachments` button."
msgstr ""
"Ако трябва да бъдат добавени прикачени файлове, кликнете върху бутона "
":icon:`fa-paperclip` :guilabel:`Прикачени файлове`, и се появява прозорец за "
"избор на файлове. Отидете до желания файл и кликнете върху "
":guilabel:`Отваряне`, за да го прикачите към имейла. Прикаченият файл се "
"зарежда и се показва над бутона :icon:`fa-paperclip` :guilabel:`Прикачени "
"файлове`."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/recruitment_flow.rst:103
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Answer deadline` field specifies when the interview form must "
"be completed by, and is populated with a date and time two weeks in the "
"future. To modify this, click on the displayed date and time, navigate to "
"the desired date and click the date to select it. Next, select the time the "
"interview is due by clicking into the displayed time, and clicking the "
"desired new deadline."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/recruitment_flow.rst:108
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Mail Template` field is pre-populated based on the "
"configuration for the interview. A different template can be chosen from the "
"drop-down menu, if desired. If a new template is selected, the new email "
"template loads in the email body."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/recruitment_flow.rst:112
msgid ""
"To send the email with the interview link to the applicant, "
"click :guilabel:`Send` at the bottom of the *Send an interview* pop-up "
"window."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/recruitment_flow.rst:122
msgid "Qualification"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/recruitment_flow.rst:124
msgid ""
"If an applicant is determined to be a good potential candidate, they are "
"moved to the :guilabel:`Qualification` stage."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/recruitment_flow.rst:127
msgid ""
"This stage exists to sort candidates that have potential from those that do "
"not meet the requirements. No automatic actions, such as emails, are set for "
"this stage. This stage informs the recruitment team to potentially set up a "
"phone call or an interview with the candidate."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/recruitment_flow.rst:132
msgid ""
"In order to move an applicant's card from one stage to another, the "
"applicant's card can either be dragged and dropped in the Kanban view of the "
"*Applications* page to the desired stage, or the stage can be modified on "
"the applicant's card."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/recruitment_flow.rst:136
msgid ""
"To change the stage on the applicant's card, first click the desired "
"applicant's card from the *Applications* page. The current stage for the "
"card is highlighted at the top on a status bar, above the card."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/recruitment_flow.rst:140
msgid ""
"Click the desired stage for the card, and the stage changes. A log note "
"indicating the stage change appears in the chatter, as well."
msgstr ""
"Кликнете върху желания етап за картата, и етапът се променя. В чатъра се "
"появява и бележка в дневника, показваща промяната на етапа."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/recruitment_flow.rst:0
msgid ""
"Change the stage of an applicant by clicking on the desired stage at the top "
"of the\n"
"applicant's card."
msgstr ""
"Промяна на етапа на кандидат чрез кликване върху желания етап в горната част "
"на\n"
"картата на кандидата."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/recruitment_flow.rst:150
msgid "First interview"
msgstr "Първо интервю"

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/recruitment_flow.rst:152
msgid ""
"After an applicant has passed the :guilabel:`Qualification` stage, they can "
"be manually moved to the :guilabel:`First Interview` stage on the "
"*Applications* page, while in Kanban view."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/recruitment_flow.rst:155
msgid ""
"To move the applicant to the next stage, drag and drop the applicant's card "
"to the :guilabel:`First Interview` stage."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/recruitment_flow.rst:158
msgid ""
"Alternatively, open the desired applicant's card from the *Applications* "
"page, and click the :guilabel:`First Interview` stage on the status bar at "
"the top of the individual applicant's card."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/recruitment_flow.rst:162
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`First Interview` stage can be modified, so when the "
"applicant's card moves to the :guilabel:`First Interview` stage, an email "
"can be automatically sent to the applicant, stating an interview is "
"requested. In this preconfigured email template, a link to the recruiting "
"team's calendar appears, allowing the applicant to schedule their interview."
msgstr ""
"Етапът :guilabel:`Първо интервю` може да бъде променен, така че когато "
"картата на кандидата премине в етап :guilabel:`Първо интервю`, до кандидата "
"автоматично може да бъде изпратен имейл, съобщаващ, че се изисква интервю. В "
"този предварително конфигуриран имейл шаблон се появява връзка към календара "
"на екипа по подбор на персонал, позволяваща на кандидата да насрочи своето "
"интервю."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/recruitment_flow.rst:167
msgid ""
":ref:`Edit <recruitment/edit-stage>` the :guilabel:`First Interview` stage, "
"and select the :guilabel:`Recruitment: Schedule Interview` option in "
"the :guilabel:`Email Template` field to automate this action."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/recruitment_flow.rst:174
msgid "Second interview"
msgstr "Второ интервю"

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/recruitment_flow.rst:176
msgid ""
"After an applicant has passed the :guilabel:`First Interview` stage, they "
"can be moved to the :guilabel:`Second Interview` stage. To move the "
"applicant to the next stage, drag and drop the applicant's card to "
"the :guilabel:`Second Interview` stage from the Kanban view of the "
"*Applications* page, or click on the :guilabel:`Second Interview` stage at "
"the top of the individual applicant's card."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/recruitment_flow.rst:182
msgid ""
"When the applicant's card moves to the :guilabel:`Second Interview` stage, "
"there are no automatic activities or emails configured for this stage, by "
"default. The recruiter can now :ref:`schedule a second interview "
"<recruitment/schedule_interviews/recruitment-scheduled>` with the applicant, "
"following the same process as the first interview."
msgstr ""
"Когато картата на кандидата премине в етап :guilabel:`Второ интервю`, за "
"този етап по подразбиране не са конфигурирани автоматични дейности или "
"имейли. Сега специалистът по подбор на персонал може да :ref:`насрочи второ "
"интервю <recruitment/schedule_interviews/recruitment-scheduled>` с "
"кандидата, следвайки същия процес като при първото интервю."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/recruitment_flow.rst:192
msgid ""
"After the applicant has completed the various interview processes, the next "
"step is to :doc:`send the job offer <offer_job_positions>`."
msgstr ""
"След като кандидатът премине през различните етапи на интервюиране, "
"следващата стъпка е :doc:`изпращане на предложение за работа "
"<offer_job_positions>`."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/recruitment_flow.rst:195
msgid ""
"Once the offer has been sent, drag and drop the applicant's card to "
"the :guilabel:`Contract Proposal` stage from the Kanban view of the "
"*Applications* page, or click on the :guilabel:`Contract Proposal` stage at "
"the top of the individual applicant's card."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/recruitment_flow.rst:202
msgid ""
"Once the contract has been fully signed by all parties, and the applicant "
"has been hired, the applicant's card moves to the :guilabel:`Contract "
"Signed` stage."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/recruitment_flow.rst:205
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Contract Signed` is folded by default on the *Applications* "
"page, and must be expanded before the applicant's card can be manually "
"moved. Click the :icon:`fa-caret-left` :icon:`fa-caret-"
"right` :guilabel:`(Unfold)` icon above the :guilabel:`Contract Signed` "
"stage, and the stage expands. Next, drag and drop the applicant's card to "
"the :guilabel:`Contract Signed` stage from the Kanban view, or click "
"the :guilabel:`Contract Signed` stage at the top of the individual "
"applicant's card."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/recruitment_flow.rst:213
msgid "Refused"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/recruitment_flow.rst:215
msgid ""
"At any point in the recruitment process, a candidate can be :doc:`refused "
"<refuse_applicant>`."
msgstr ""
"На всеки етап от процеса на подбор на персонал, на кандидат може да бъде "
":doc:`отказано <refuse_applicant>`."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/refuse_applicant.rst:3
msgid "Refuse applicants"
msgstr "Отказване на кандидати"

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/refuse_applicant.rst:5
msgid ""
"At any point in the recruitment process, an applicant can be refused for a "
"job position."
msgstr ""
"На всеки етап от процеса на подбор на персонал, на кандидат може да бъде "
"отказана длъжност."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/refuse_applicant.rst:7
msgid ""
"To refuse an applicant, start by navigating to the applicant's card in the "
"**Recruitment** app. This is done in one of two ways:"
msgstr ""
"За да откажете кандидат, започнете, като отидете на картата на кандидата в "
"приложението **Recruitment**. Това може да се направи по един от следните "
"два начина:"

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/refuse_applicant.rst:10
msgid ""
"Open the main *Job Positions* dashboard by navigating "
"to :menuselection:`Recruitment app --> Applications --> By Job Positions`. "
"Next, click on the desired job position card, then click on the individual "
"applicant card from the *Applications* page."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/refuse_applicant.rst:13
msgid ""
"Navigate to :menuselection:`Recruitment app --> Applications --> All "
"Applications`. In the :guilabel:`Applications` list, click anywhere on the "
"desired applicant's line to open that specific applicant's card."
msgstr ""
"Отидете на :menuselection:`приложението Recruitment --> Applications --> All "
"Applications`. В списъка :guilabel:`Applications`, кликнете навсякъде върху "
"реда на желания кандидат, за да отворите картата на този конкретен кандидат."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/refuse_applicant.rst:17
msgid ""
"At the top of the applicant's card, there are several buttons. Click the one "
"labeled :guilabel:`Refuse`."
msgstr ""
"В горната част на картата на кандидата има няколко бутона. Кликнете върху "
"този, озаглавен :guilabel:`Отказ`."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/refuse_applicant.rst:23
msgid "Refuse reasons"
msgstr "Причини за отказ"

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/refuse_applicant.rst:25
msgid ""
"*Refuse reasons* allow recruiters to document why an applicant was not a "
"good fit, and send specific refusal reason email templates to the applicant."
msgstr ""
"*Причините за отказ* позволяват на специалистите по подбор на персонал да "
"документират защо даден кандидат не е бил подходящ, и да изпращат до "
"кандидата конкретни имейл шаблони, съответстващи на причината за отказ."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/refuse_applicant.rst:28
msgid ""
"Clicking :guilabel:`Refuse` on an applicant's form makes the *Refuse Reason* "
"pop-up window appear."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/refuse_applicant.rst:30
msgid ""
"The default refuse reasons in Odoo, and their corresponding :ref:`refusal "
"email <recruitment/refuse_applicant/send-refusal-email>` templates, are:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/refuse_applicant.rst:37
msgid "Email Template"
msgstr "Имейл шаблон"

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/refuse_applicant.rst:38
msgid "Refusal Reason"
msgstr "Причина за отказ"

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/refuse_applicant.rst:39
msgid ":guilabel:`Recruitment: Refuse`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Recruitment: Отказ`"

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/refuse_applicant.rst:0
msgid ":guilabel:`Does not fit the job requirements`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Не отговаря на изискванията за длъжността`"

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/refuse_applicant.rst:0
msgid ":guilabel:`Job already fulfilled`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Длъжността вече е заета`"

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/refuse_applicant.rst:0
msgid ":guilabel:`Duplicate`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Дублиране`"

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/refuse_applicant.rst:0
msgid ":guilabel:`Spam`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Спам`"

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/refuse_applicant.rst:44
msgid ":guilabel:`Recruitment: Not interested anymore`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Recruitment: Вече не проявява интерес`"

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/refuse_applicant.rst:0
msgid ":guilabel:`Refused by applicant: job fit`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Отказан от кандидата: несъответствие с длъжността`"

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/refuse_applicant.rst:0
msgid ":guilabel:`Refused by applicant: salary`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Отказан от кандидата: заплата`"

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/refuse_applicant.rst:48
msgid ""
"Additional refusal reasons :ref:`can be created, and existing ones can be "
"modified (or deleted) <recruitment/refuse_applicant/new-refuse>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/refuse_applicant.rst:54
msgid "Create or modify refuse reasons"
msgstr "Създаване или промяна на причини за отказ"

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/refuse_applicant.rst:56
msgid ""
"To view and configure refuse reasons, navigate "
"to :menuselection:`Recruitment app --> Configuration --> Refuse Reasons`. "
"Doing so reveals the *Refuse Reasons* page, where all the existing refusal "
"reasons are listed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/refuse_applicant.rst:60
msgid ""
"To create a new refuse reason from the *Refuse Reasons* page, click "
"the :guilabel:`New` button. A blank line appears at the bottom of the list, "
"with an empty field present in the :guilabel:`Description` column."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/refuse_applicant.rst:64
msgid ""
"Type in the new refuse reason in the field. It is recommended to enter a "
"reason that is short and concise, such as `Offer expired` or `Withdrew "
"application`."
msgstr ""
"Въведете новата причина за отказ в полето. Препоръчително е да въведете "
"кратка и ясна причина, като например `Offer expired` или `Withdrew "
"application`."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/refuse_applicant.rst:67
msgid ""
"Then, click in the :guilabel:`Email Template` field to reveal a drop-down "
"menu. Select the desired email template from the list to be used when the "
"new refuse reason is selected."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/refuse_applicant.rst:70
msgid ""
"If a new email template is desired, type in the name for the new template in "
"the field. Then, click :guilabel:`Create and edit...`, and a *Create Email "
"Template* pop-up window appears."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/refuse_applicant.rst:73
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Template Name` field is populated with the name entered in "
"the :guilabel:`Email Template` column by default, but can be modified if "
"desired. Enter the email :guilabel:`Subject` in the corresponding field, and "
"add the email content in the *Body* tab. To include attachments, click the "
"*Options* tab, and add the attachment using the :icon:`fa-"
"paperclip` :guilabel:`Attachments` button. To assign an :guilabel:`Owner` "
"for the template, select a user in the drop-down menu. Enter "
"a :guilabel:`Template Description` in the corresponding field."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/refuse_applicant.rst:80
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Save`, and Odoo returns to the *Refuse Reasons* list."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/refuse_applicant.rst:82
msgid ""
"The new template appears in the new refuse reason :guilabel:`Email Template` "
"field."
msgstr ""
"Новият шаблон се показва в полето :guilabel:`Email Template` на новата "
"причина за отказ."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/refuse_applicant.rst:85
msgid ""
"Pre-configured recruitment refusal email templates in Odoo use dynamic "
"placeholders, which are personalized placeholders that populate data from "
"the applicant's record in the email body."
msgstr ""
"Предварително конфигурираните имейл шаблони за отказ при подбор на персонал "
"в Odoo използват динамични плейсхолдъри, които представляват персонализирани "
"плейсхолдъри, попълващи данни от записа на кандидата в тялото на имейла."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/refuse_applicant.rst:88
msgid ""
"For example, if the applicant's name is used in a dynamic placeholder, the "
"applicant's name appears anytime that dynamic placeholder appears on the "
"email template."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/refuse_applicant.rst:91
msgid ""
"For more detailed information on email templates, refer to the :doc:`../../"
"general/companies/email_template` documentation."
msgstr ""
"За по-подробна информация относно имейл шаблоните, вижте документацията "
":doc:`../../general/companies/email_template`."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/refuse_applicant.rst:97
msgid "Send refusal email"
msgstr "Изпращане на имейл за отказ"

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/refuse_applicant.rst:99
msgid ""
"After clicking the :guilabel:`Refuse` button on an applicant form, "
"a :ref:`refuse reason <recruitment/refuse-reasons>` is selected from the "
"*Refuse Reason* pop-up window."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/refuse_applicant.rst:102
msgid ""
"The applicant's email address automatically populates "
"the :guilabel:`Applicant` field. The :guilabel:`Subject` and email body are "
"populated according to the corresponding email template."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/refuse_applicant.rst:105
msgid ""
"To send the refusal email to the applicant, click :guilabel:`Refuse` at the "
"bottom of the *Refuse Reason* pop-up window. The refusal email is sent to "
"the applicant, and a red :guilabel:`Refused` banner appears on the "
"applicant's card in the corner."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/refuse_applicant.rst:110
msgid ""
"If an application should be refused but an email should **not** be sent (if, "
"for example, the application was spam), click the :guilabel:`Send Email` "
"toggle to deactivate it, and click :guilabel:`Refuse` at the bottom of the "
"*Refuse Reason* pop-up window."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/refuse_applicant.rst:None
msgid ""
"The refuse reason pop-up window, with the email subject and body populated."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/refuse_applicant.rst:118
msgid "Refuse duplicate applicant"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/refuse_applicant.rst:120
msgid ""
"Occasionally, applicants apply multiple times for the same job position. "
"When this occurs, it is possible to refuse all their applications at once, "
"instead of individually."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/refuse_applicant.rst:123
msgid ""
"In this situation, a :guilabel:`Refuse Duplicate Applications` toggle "
"appears on the *Refuse Reason* pop-up window. Enable the toggle, and "
"a :guilabel:`Duplicate Applications` field appears beneath it, listing the "
"applicant's name for each duplicate application in the system."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/refuse_applicant.rst:127
msgid ""
"To refuse *all* applications for that applicant, click "
"the :guilabel:`Refuse` button."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/refuse_applicant.rst:129
msgid ""
"The applicant is only sent one email, and all their applications for the job "
"position are marked as *Refused*."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/refuse_applicant.rst:None
msgid "Duplicate applications refused in one email."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/refuse_applicant.rst:136
msgid "View refused applicants"
msgstr "Преглед на отказани кандидати"

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/refuse_applicant.rst:138
msgid ""
"After refusal, the applicant's card is hidden by default. However, it is "
"still possible to view applicants who have been refused :ref:`by job "
"position <recruitment/refuse_applicant/job-refused>`, or view :ref:`all "
"refused applicants <recruitment/refuse_applicant/all-refused>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/refuse_applicant.rst:145
msgid "By job position"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/refuse_applicant.rst:147
msgid ""
"To view the refused applicants for a specific job position, navigate "
"to :menuselection:`Recruitment app --> Applications --> By Job Positions`, "
"then click the desired job position Kanban card."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/refuse_applicant.rst:150
msgid ""
"On the *Applications* page, click the :icon:`fa-caret-"
"down` :guilabel:`(Toggle Search Panel)` button in the search bar, then "
"click :guilabel:`Refused` in the :icon:`fa-filter` :guilabel:`Filters` "
"column."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/refuse_applicant.rst:154
msgid ""
"All applicants that have been refused for the job position appear in the "
"stage they were in when they were refused, and all other applicants are "
"hidden."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/refuse_applicant.rst:None
msgid "All applicants refused for a job position."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/refuse_applicant.rst:163
msgid "All refused applicants"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/refuse_applicant.rst:165
msgid ""
"To view all refused applicants across all job positions, navigate "
"to :menuselection:`Recruitment app --> Applications --> All Applications`. "
"Every applicant record is displayed in a default list view."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/refuse_applicant.rst:168
msgid ""
"Click the :icon:`fa-caret-down` :guilabel:`(Toggle Search Panel)` button in "
"the search bar, then click :guilabel:`Refused` in the :icon:`fa-"
"funnel` :guilabel:`Filters` column."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/refuse_applicant.rst:171
msgid ""
"All applicants that have been refused appear, with the text in red. Along "
"with the applicant's :guilabel:`Name`, the date they :guilabel:`Applied on`, "
"the :guilabel:`Job Position`, :guilabel:`Stage` they were in when refused, "
"their :guilabel:`Matching` percentage, any :guilabel:`Tags`, and "
"the :guilabel:`Recruiter` responsible for the job position are listed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/refuse_applicant.rst:None
msgid "All applicants refused for all job positions."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:3
msgid "Schedule interviews"
msgstr "Планиране на интервюта"

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:5
msgid ""
"Once an applicant has reached the *First Interview* stage, it is time to "
"schedule an in-person, virtual, or phone interview. This can be done in one "
"of two ways through the **Recruitment** app, either by the :ref:`recruitment "
"team <recruitment/schedule_interviews/recruitment-scheduled>`, or by "
"the :ref:`applicant <recruitment/schedule_interviews/applicant-scheduled>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:10
msgid ""
"With a single drag and drop action, Odoo sends the applicant an email with a "
"self-service scheduling link. The applicant selects an available time slot, "
"and the meeting is automatically added to the calendars of all participants. "
"This eliminates the need for back-and-forth emails or phone calls."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:17
msgid "Recruitment team scheduled interviews"
msgstr "Интервюта, насрочени от екипа по подбор на персонала"

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:19
msgid ""
"When an applicant reaches an interview stage, the recruitment team schedules "
"the interview by first coordinating a suitable date and time with the "
"applicant and interviewers."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:22
msgid ""
"To schedule an interview, navigate to the applicant's card by going to "
"the :menuselection:`Recruitment` app and clicking the relevant job card. "
"Click the desired applicant's card on the *Applications* page."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:26
msgid ""
"To schedule a phone, virtual, or in-person interview, click the :icon:`fa-"
"calendar` :guilabel:`No Meeting` smart button at the top of the applicant's "
"record."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:30
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Meetings` smart button displays :icon:`fa-"
"calendar` :guilabel:`No Meeting` if no meetings are currently scheduled. For "
"applicants who are new to the :guilabel:`First Interview` stage, this is the "
"default."
msgstr ""
"Интелигентният бутон :guilabel:`Срещи` показва :icon:`fa-calendar` "
":guilabel:`Няма среща`, ако в момента няма насрочени срещи. За кандидати, "
"които тепърва влизат в етапа :guilabel:`Първо интервю`, това е стойността по "
"подразбиране."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:34
msgid ""
"If there is one meeting already scheduled, the smart button "
"displays :guilabel:`1 Meeting`, with the date of the upcoming meeting "
"beneath it. If more than one meeting is scheduled, the button "
"displays :guilabel:`Next Meeting`, with the date of the first upcoming "
"meeting beneath it."
msgstr ""
"Ако вече има насрочена една среща, интелигентният бутон показва :guilabel:`1 "
"среща`, а под него — датата на предстоящата среща. Ако са насрочени повече "
"от една срещи, бутонът показва :guilabel:`Следваща среща`, а под него — "
"датата на първата предстояща среща."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:38
msgid ""
"Clicking the :guilabel:`Meetings` smart button loads a calendar, showing the "
"scheduled meetings and events for the currently signed-in user, as well as "
"the user's favorites configured in the **Calendar** app. To hide any user's "
"schedules from the calendar, uncheck the box next to their name."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:43
msgid ""
"To view only the schedules of the user and the interviewers, "
"click :guilabel:`+ Add Attendees` at the bottom of the :guilabel:`Attendees` "
"list and add each desired interviewer from the resulting drop-down menu."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:None
msgid "The calendar view, highlighting how to change the displayed meetings."
msgstr "Изгледът на календара, показващ как да промените показваните срещи."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:50
msgid ""
"To add a meeting to the calendar when in the *Day* or *Week* view, click on "
"the start time of the meeting and drag down to the end time. Doing so "
"selects the date, time, and length of the meeting. A meeting can also be "
"added by clicking the :guilabel:`New` button."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:54
msgid ""
"Both methods cause a :ref:`New Event <recruitment/schedule_interviews/event-"
"card>` pop-up window to appear."
msgstr ""
"И двата метода водят до появата на изскачащ прозорец :ref:`Ново събитие "
"<recruitment/schedule_interviews/event-card>`."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:60
msgid "New event pop-up window"
msgstr "Изскачащ прозорец за ново събитие"

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:62
msgid ""
"Configure the information for the interview on the *New Event* pop-up "
"window. The only required information is the meeting title, date, and time."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:65
msgid ""
":icon:`fa-tag` :guilabel:`(Booking Name)`: Enter the title for the meeting. "
"The default subject is the applicant's name."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:67
msgid ""
":icon:`fa-clock-o` :guilabel:`(Dates)`: Configure the start and end date and "
"times for the meeting. Clicking either of these fields opens a calendar pop-"
"up window. Click on the desired date to select it, enter the times in the "
"corresponding fields, then click :guilabel:`Apply`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:70
msgid ""
":guilabel:`All Day`: Click the box to schedule an all-day interview. If this "
"box is ticked, the :icon:`fa-clock-o` :guilabel:`(Dates)` fields change to "
"display the date only."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:72
msgid ""
":icon:`fa-user` :guilabel:`(Participants)`: Select the people attending the "
"meeting. The default attendees are the prospective candidate and the "
"assigned recruiters for the job position. Add as many other people as "
"desired."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:75
msgid ""
":icon:`fa-map` :guilabel:`(Location)`: Enter the address for the interview."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:76
msgid ""
":icon:`fa-video-camera` :guilabel:`(Videocall URL)`: If the meeting is "
"virtual, or if a virtual option is available, click :icon:`fa-"
"plus` :guilabel:`Video`, and a URL is automatically created and populates "
"this field."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:79
msgid ""
":icon:`fa-lock` :guilabel:`(Visibility)`: Determine who can see the meeting "
"using the drop-down menu. The default options "
"are :guilabel:`Public`, :guilabel:`Private`, and :guilabel:`Only internal "
"users`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:82
msgid ""
":icon:`fa-sticky-note` :guilabel:`Notes`: Enter any relevant notes in this "
"field. There is an option to enter formatted text, such as numbered lists, "
"headings, tables, links, photos, and more. Use the powerbox feature by "
"typing a `/` to reveal a list of options. Scroll through the options and "
"click on the desired item. The item appears in the field and can be "
"modified. Each command presents a different pop-up window. Follow the "
"instructions for each command to complete the entry."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:89
msgid ""
"Once the card details are entered, click :guilabel:`Save` to save the "
"changes and schedule the interview."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:None
msgid "The New Event pop-up window configured for an interview."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:98
msgid "More options"
msgstr "Още опции"

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:100
msgid ""
"To add additional information to the meeting, click the :guilabel:`More "
"Options` button of the :ref:`New Event <recruitment/schedule_interviews/"
"event-card>` pop-up window. Enter any of the following additional fields:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:104
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Duration`: This field auto-populates based on "
"the :guilabel:`Start` (and end) date and time. If the meeting time is "
"adjusted, this field automatically adjusts to the correct duration. The "
"default length of a meeting is one hour."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:107
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Linked to`: The applicant being interviewed. This field cannot be "
"modified. Click the applicant's name to view the applicant's card."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:109
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Status`: Select if the interviewers are marked "
"as :guilabel:`Busy` or :guilabel:`Available` during the interview. This "
"field is set to :guilabel:`Busy` by default."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:111
msgid ""
":guilabel:`# guests`: This field displays the number of people invited to "
"the meeting."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:112
msgid ""
":guilabel:`# Awaiting`: The number of guests that have not responded to the "
"meeting invitation."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:113
msgid ""
":icon:`fa-envelope` :guilabel:`Email`: Click this to email the meeting "
"guests with any updates."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:114
msgid ""
":icon:`fa-mobile` :guilabel:`SMS`: Click this to send an SMS message to the "
"meeting guests."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:None
msgid "A new meeting card with all the details populated, and ready to save."
msgstr "Нова карта за среща с попълнени всички данни, готова за запазване."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:120
msgid "Send meeting to attendees"
msgstr "Изпращане на срещата до участниците"

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:122
msgid ""
"Once the meeting details are correct, the meeting can be sent to the "
"attendees via :ref:`email <recruitment/schedule_interviews/email>` "
"or :ref:`SMS <recruitment/schedule_interviews/sms>`. This is done from "
"the :ref:`expanded event form <recruitment/schedule_interviews/more-"
"options>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:129
msgid "Via email"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:131
msgid ""
"To send the meeting via email, click the :icon:`fa-"
"envelope` :guilabel:`Email` button next to the :guilabel:`Attendees` field "
"on the expanded meeting form."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:134
msgid ""
"A *Contact Attendees* email configurator pop-up window appears. A pre-"
"formatted email using the default :guilabel:`Calendar: Event Update` email "
"template populates the email body field."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:137
msgid ""
"All meeting guests are added to the :guilabel:`To` field by default. Make "
"any desired changes to the email, then click :guilabel:`Send` to send the "
"email."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:143
msgid "Via SMS"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:145
msgid ""
"To send the meeting via SMS, click the :icon:`fa-mobile` :guilabel:`SMS` "
"button next to the :guilabel:`Attendees` field on the expanded meeting form. "
"A *Send SMS* pop-up window appears."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:148
msgid ""
"At the top, a blue banner appears if any attendees do not have valid phone "
"numbers, and lists how many records are invalid. If a contact does not have "
"a valid mobile number listed, click :guilabel:`Discard`, edit the attendee's "
"record, then redo these steps."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:152
msgid ""
"When no warning message appears, type in the message to be sent to the "
"attendees in the main text field. To add any emojis to the message, click "
"the :icon:`oi-smile-add` :guilabel:`(smile add)` icon on the side of the pop-"
"up window."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:156
msgid ""
"The number of characters and amount of text messages required to send the "
"message (according to GSM-7 criteria) appears beneath the text field. "
"Click :guilabel:`Put in queue` to have the text sent later, after any other "
"messages are scheduled, or click :guilabel:`Send now` to send the message "
"immediately."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:162
#: ../../content/applications/hr/referrals/share_jobs.rst:95
msgid ""
"Sending text messages is **not** a default capability with Odoo. To send "
"text messages, credits are required, which need to be purchased. For more "
"information on IAP credits and plans, refer to the :doc:`../../essentials/"
"in_app_purchase` documentation."
msgstr ""
"Изпращането на текстови съобщения **не** е стандартна възможност в Odoo. За "
"да изпращате текстови съобщения, е необходимо да закупите кредити. За повече "
"информация относно IAP кредитите и плановете, вижте документацията :doc:`../"
"../essentials/in_app_purchase`."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:169
msgid "Applicant scheduled interviews"
msgstr "Интервюта, насрочени от кандидата"

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:171
msgid ""
"Coordinating interview times typically requires several email exchanges or "
"phone calls, and can slow the recruitment process. Enabling Odoo's self-"
"service scheduling removes that bottleneck. When an applicant is moved to an "
"interview stage, the system automatically sends a scheduling link, records "
"the selected slot, and updates all relevant calendars."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:176
msgid ""
"This automation is turned off by default. To activate this, :ref:`modify "
"<recruitment/schedule_interviews/modify-stage>` the :guilabel:`First "
"Interview` and :guilabel:`Second Interview` stages and assign "
"the :guilabel:`Recruitment: Schedule Interview` email template to them."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:186
msgid ""
":ref:`Modify <recruitment/modify-stages>` the :guilabel:`First Interview` "
"or :guilabel:`Second Interview` stage so the stage's :guilabel:`Email "
"Template` field is set to :guilabel:`Recruitment: Schedule Interview`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:None
msgid ""
"The Recruitment: Schedule Interview email template populating the Email "
"Template field."
msgstr ""
"Шаблонът за имейл Recruitment: Планиране на интервю, попълнен в полето "
"Шаблон за имейл."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:194
#: ../../content/applications/hr/referrals/share_jobs.rst:55
msgid "Send email"
msgstr "Изпращане на имейл"

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:196
msgid ""
"After configuring the :guilabel:`First Interview` or :guilabel:`Second "
"Interview` stages to :ref:`send emails <recruitment/schedule_interviews/"
"modify-stage>`, drag and drop the applicant card into one of these stages to "
"send the email."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:201
msgid "Self-scheduled interview"
msgstr "Самостоятелно насрочено интервю"

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:203
msgid ""
"When the applicant receives the email, they click the :guilabel:`Schedule my "
"interview` button at the bottom of the email. This navigates the applicant "
"to a private online scheduling page, which is **only** accessible through "
"the emailed link."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:207
msgid ""
"This page displays the :guilabel:`Meeting Details` on the side of the screen "
"which includes the format and length of the meeting. In this example, the "
"interview is virtual (:icon:`fa-video-camera` :guilabel:`Online`) and the "
"duration is one hour (:icon:`fa-clock-o` :guilabel:`1 hour`)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:211
msgid ""
"The applicant clicks on an available day on the calendar, signified by "
"purple text. Once a day is selected, they click one of the available times "
"to select that date and time."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:None
msgid "The calendar screen with dates and times to schedule an interview."
msgstr "Екранът на календара с дати и часове за насрочване на интервю."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:218
msgid ""
"Be sure to check the :guilabel:`Timezone` field beneath the calendar to "
"ensure it is set to the correct time zone. Changing the time zone may alter "
"the available times presented."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:221
msgid ""
"Once the date and time are selected, the applicant is navigated to an *Add "
"more details about you* page. This page prompts the applicant to enter "
"their :guilabel:`Full name`, :guilabel:`Email`, and :guilabel:`Phone "
"number`, all of which are required. The contact information entered on this "
"form is used to remind the applicant about the scheduled interview."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:226
msgid ""
"When everything is entered, the applicant clicks the :guilabel:`Confirm "
"Appointment` button, and the interview is scheduled."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:229
msgid ""
"After confirming the interview, the applicant is taken to a confirmation "
"page, where all the details of the interview are displayed. The option to "
"add the meeting to the applicant's personal calendars is available, through "
"the :guilabel:`Add to iCal/Outlook` and :guilabel:`Add to Google Agenda` "
"buttons, beneath the interview details."
msgstr ""
"След потвърждаване на интервюто, кандидатът се отвежда до страница за "
"потвърждение, където се показват всички данни за интервюто. Налична е опция "
"за добавяне на срещата към личните календари на кандидата чрез бутоните "
":guilabel:`Добавяне към iCal/Outlook` и :guilabel:`Добавяне към Google "
"Agenda`, разположени под данните за интервюто."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:234
msgid ""
"The applicant is also able to cancel the interview if necessary, with "
"the :guilabel:`Cancel your appointment` button at the bottom of the "
"confirmation."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/schedule_interviews.rst:None
msgid "The confirmation page with all the details for the interview displayed."
msgstr "Страницата за потвърждение с всички показани данни за интервюто."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/source_analysis.rst:3
msgid "Source analysis"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/source_analysis.rst:5
msgid ""
"Reporting is a critical tool used by recruiting departments to gain insights "
"into the entire recruitment process."
msgstr ""
"Отчитането е важен инструмент, използван от отделите по подбор на персонал, "
"за да получат представа за целия процес по подбор."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/source_analysis.rst:8
msgid ""
"Determining where applicants come from can provide information about which "
"sources have the best results. This information is determined by the *Source "
"Analysis* report. With this data, recruitment teams can better pivot their "
"recruiting strategies to gain better applicants, in both quantity and "
"quality."
msgstr ""
"Определянето откъде идват кандидатите може да предостави информация кои "
"източници дават най-добри резултати. Тази информация се определя чрез отчета "
"*Анализ на източниците*. С тези данни екипите по подбор на персонал могат по-"
"добре да пренасочат стратегиите си за набиране, за да привлекат по-добри "
"кандидати, както по количество, така и по качество."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/source_analysis.rst:14
#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/team_performance.rst:12
msgid "Open report"
msgstr "Отваряне на отчета"

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/source_analysis.rst:16
msgid ""
"To access the *Source Analysis* report, navigate "
"to :menuselection:`Recruitment app --> Reporting --> Source Analysis`."
msgstr ""
"За достъп до отчета *Анализ на източниците*, отидете на "
":menuselection:`Recruitment app --> Отчитане --> Анализ на източниците`."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/source_analysis.rst:19
msgid ""
"This presents the data for the last 365 days in a default :icon:`fa-"
"database` :guilabel:`(Stacked)` :icon:`fa-bar-chart` :guilabel:`(Bar Chart)` "
"view. It shows the amount of applicants by source and separated by status "
"(:guilabel:`In Progress`, :guilabel:`Hired`, and :guilabel:`Refused`),"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/source_analysis.rst:23
msgid ""
"Hover the cursor over any color-coded section of a column to view the "
"specific numbers for that status column."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/source_analysis.rst:None
msgid "The default bar chart of the source analysis information."
msgstr ""
"Стълбовидната диаграма по подразбиране на информацията от анализа на "
"източниците."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/source_analysis.rst:30
msgid "Source effectiveness report"
msgstr "Отчет за ефективността на източниците"

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/source_analysis.rst:32
msgid ""
"To identify which sources (e.g., job boards, social media, employee "
"referrals, company website) produce the most hires, the pivot table view of "
"the *Source Analysis* report can be configured to display further details."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/source_analysis.rst:36
msgid ""
"To view the *Source Analysis* report in a pivot table, click the :icon:`oi-"
"view-pivot` :guilabel:`(Pivot)` icon in the corner. The data is presented in "
"a pivot table, with rows populated by sources, and columns populated by "
"stages."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/source_analysis.rst:40
msgid ""
"To expand this chart to show what specific job positions the applicants "
"applied to from each source, click the :icon:`fa-plus-"
"square` :guilabel:`Total` box above the columns to reveal a drop-down menu, "
"and click :guilabel:`Job Position`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/source_analysis.rst:44
msgid ""
"Each column is then grouped by the job position, such as *Accountant* or "
"*Carpenter*. Each job position displays a separate count for "
"applications :guilabel:`In Progress`, :guilabel:`Refused`, "
"or :guilabel:`Hired`, and an :guilabel:`Applications` column which displays "
"the total count of all statuses."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/source_analysis.rst:None
msgid ""
"The pivot table view displaying each job position and its source and stage."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/source_analysis.rst:53
msgid "Medium"
msgstr "Медия"

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/source_analysis.rst:55
msgid ""
"Viewing the medium for the applicants can be beneficial to see which "
"specific medium is more successful."
msgstr ""
"Преглеждането на медията за кандидатите може да бъде полезно, за да се види "
"коя конкретна медия е по-успешна."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/source_analysis.rst:58
msgid ""
"*Mediums* are the specific methods the applicant used to discover and then "
"apply for job positions, such as a search engine, social media ad, email, "
"banner, etc."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/source_analysis.rst:61
msgid ""
"To further group the results by medium, click into one of the :icon:`fa-plus-"
"square` :guilabel:`(Source)` rows then click :guilabel:`Medium` in the "
"resulting drop-down menu. The row presents the individual mediums relevant "
"to that specific source."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/source_analysis.rst:65
msgid ""
"Once :guilabel:`Medium` is selected for one source, clicking into another "
"row automatically reveals the specific metrics for the mediums for that "
"source."
msgstr ""
"След като :guilabel:`Медия` е избрана за един източник, кликването в друг "
"ред автоматично разкрива конкретните метрики за медиите на този източник."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/source_analysis.rst:69
msgid ""
"The only mediums that appear for a source are mediums that have been set on "
"an applicant's form. If a medium has **not** been set for any applicants, "
"the medium does not appear in the drop-down rows beneath the source."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/source_analysis.rst:73
msgid ""
"For example, if no applicants applied with the medium *Google Adwords*, that "
"medium does **not** appear beneath the *Search engine* source row."
msgstr ""
"Например, ако нито един кандидат не е кандидатствал чрез медията *Google "
"Adwords*, тази медия **не** се показва под реда за източник *Търсачка*."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/source_analysis.rst:None
msgid "The source rows, expanded to also show the medium for each source."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/team_performance.rst:3
msgid "Team performance"
msgstr "Представяне на екипа"

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/team_performance.rst:5
msgid ""
"The *Team Performance* report in the **Recruitment** app shows how many "
"applicants each recruiter is managing."
msgstr ""
"Отчетът *Представяне на екипа* в приложението **Recruitment** показва колко "
"кандидати управлява всеки рекрутер."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/team_performance.rst:8
msgid ""
"This information is determined by the individuals populating "
"the :ref:`Recruiter <recruitment/add_applicants/applicant-details>` field on "
"each applicant form."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/team_performance.rst:14
msgid ""
"To access the *Team Performance* report, navigate "
"to :menuselection:`Recruitment app --> Reporting --> Team Performance`."
msgstr ""
"За достъп до отчета *Представяне на екипа*, отидете на "
":menuselection:`Recruitment app --> Отчитане --> Представяне на екипа`."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/team_performance.rst:17
msgid ""
"The number of :guilabel:`In Progress`, :guilabel:`Hired`, "
"and :guilabel:`Refused` applicants for each recruiter is displayed in a "
"default :icon:`fa-area-chart` :guilabel:`(Graph)` view."
msgstr ""
"Броят на кандидатите със статус :guilabel:`В процес`, :guilabel:`Наети` и "
":guilabel:`Отказани` за всеки рекрутер се показва в изглед по подразбиране "
":icon:`fa-area-chart` :guilabel:`(Графика)`."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/team_performance.rst:20
msgid ""
"The information shown is for the :icon:`fa-filter` :guilabel:`Last 365 Days "
"Applicant` default filter, as displayed in the search bar."
msgstr ""
"Показаната информация е за филтъра по подразбиране :icon:`fa-filter` "
":guilabel:`Кандидати през последните 365 дни`, както е показано в лентата за "
"търсене."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/team_performance.rst:23
msgid ""
"Hover the cursor over any column to view a popover window, displaying the "
"specific details for that column."
msgstr ""
"Задръжте курсора върху коя да е колона, за да видите изскачащ прозорец, "
"показващ конкретните подробности за тази колона."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/team_performance.rst:None
msgid "The default bar chart of the team performance report."
msgstr ""
"Стълбовидната диаграма по подразбиране на отчета за представяне на екипа."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/team_performance.rst:32
msgid ""
"For a more detailed view of the information in the :guilabel:`Team "
"Performance` report, click the :icon:`oi-view-pivot` :guilabel:`(Pivot)` "
"icon in the top-right corner. This displays all the information in a pivot "
"table."
msgstr ""
"За по-подробен изглед на информацията в отчета :guilabel:`Представяне на "
"екипа`, кликнете върху иконата :icon:`oi-view-pivot` :guilabel:`(Обобщена "
"таблица)` в горния десен ъгъл. Това показва цялата информация в обобщена "
"таблица."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/team_performance.rst:36
msgid ""
"In this view, the job positions populate the rows, while the columns "
"populate the number of applicants. The first column, :guilabel:`Applicant`, "
"is the total number of applicants across all stages for that job position. "
"The subsequent columns display the total applicants that have "
"been :guilabel:`Hired`, :guilabel:`Refused`, and :guilabel:`In Progress` for "
"each job position."
msgstr ""
"В този изглед длъжностите попълват редовете, докато колоните показват броя "
"кандидати. Първата колона, :guilabel:`Кандидат`, е общият брой кандидати във "
"всички етапи за тази длъжност. Следващите колони показват общия брой "
"кандидати, които са :guilabel:`Наети`, :guilabel:`Отказани` и :guilabel:`В "
"процес` за всяка длъжност."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/team_performance.rst:41
msgid "The displayed information can be modified, if desired."
msgstr "Показваната информация може да бъде променена, ако желаете."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/team_performance.rst:43
msgid ""
"In this example, there are 20 total applicants. Out of those 20, eight have "
"been hired, five have been refused, and seven are still in the recruitment "
"process."
msgstr ""
"В този пример има общо 20 кандидати. От тези 20, осем са наети, пет са "
"отказани, а седем все още са в процеса по подбор."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/team_performance.rst:46
msgid ""
"From the data presented, the :guilabel:`Experienced Developer` job position "
"is the most successful. This job position has one of the highest number of "
"total applicants (tied with the :guilabel:`Marketing and Community Manager` "
"position), as well as the most hires."
msgstr ""
"От представените данни длъжността :guilabel:`Опитен разработчик` е най-"
"успешна. Тази длъжност има един от най-високите общи брой кандидати (наравно "
"с длъжността :guilabel:`Мениджър маркетинг и общност`), както и най-много "
"наети."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/team_performance.rst:50
msgid ""
"This pivot table also shows that the :guilabel:`Quality Control Inspector` "
"position is the hardest to fill, as it has the fewest total applicants."
msgstr ""
"Тази обобщена таблица показва също, че длъжността :guilabel:`Инспектор по "
"контрол на качеството` е най-трудна за запълване, тъй като има най-малко "
"общо кандидати."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/team_performance.rst:57
msgid "Use case: recruiter performance over time"
msgstr "Практически пример: представяне на рекрутер във времето"

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/team_performance.rst:59
msgid ""
"One way to modify this report is to show how recruiters are performing over "
"time. To show this information, begin with the :guilabel:`Team Performance` "
"report in the :icon:`oi-view-pivot` :guilabel:`(Pivot)` view."
msgstr ""
"Един начин да промените този отчет е да покажете как се представят "
"рекрутерите във времето. За да покажете тази информация, започнете с отчета "
":guilabel:`Представяне на екипа` в изглед :icon:`oi-view-pivot` :guilabel:`"
"(Обобщена таблица)`."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/team_performance.rst:63
msgid ""
"Next, click the :icon:`fa-caret-down` :guilabel:`(down arrow)` in the search "
"bar, revealing a drop-down menu. Click :guilabel:`Add Custom "
"Group` :icon:`fa-caret-down` at the bottom of the :icon:`oi-"
"group` :guilabel:`Group By` column, then click :guilabel:`Recruiter`. Click "
"away from the drop-down menu to close it. Now, each row on the table "
"represents a recruiter."
msgstr ""
"След това кликнете върху :icon:`fa-caret-down` :guilabel:`(стрелка надолу)` "
"в лентата за търсене, за да се покаже падащо меню. Кликнете върху "
":guilabel:`Добавяне на персонализирана група` :icon:`fa-caret-down` в "
"долната част на колоната :icon:`oi-group` :guilabel:`Групиране по`, след "
"което кликнете върху :guilabel:`Рекрутер`. Кликнете извън падащото меню, за "
"да го затворите. Сега всеки ред в таблицата представлява рекрутер."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/team_performance.rst:None
msgid "The pivot table now displaying the recruiters in the rows."
msgstr "Обобщената таблица, показваща вече рекрутерите в редовете."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/team_performance.rst:71
msgid ""
"To compare the team's performance over different time periods, click "
"the :icon:`fa-caret-down` :guilabel:`(down arrow)` in the search bar. "
"Click :guilabel:`Application Date` :icon:`fa-caret-down` in the :icon:`fa-"
"filter` :guilabel:`Filters` column, revealing various time periods to select."
msgstr ""
"За да сравните представянето на екипа за различни периоди от време, кликнете "
"върху :icon:`fa-caret-down` :guilabel:`(стрелка надолу)` в лентата за "
"търсене. Кликнете върху :guilabel:`Дата на кандидатстване` :icon:`fa-caret-"
"down` в колоната :icon:`fa-filter` :guilabel:`Филтри`, за да се покажат "
"различни периоди от време за избор."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/team_performance.rst:75
msgid ""
"In this example, the desired data is the comparison between the team's "
"performance in the third quarter (June - August) and the second quarter "
"(April - July). To do so, click :guilabel:`Q3`. Once clicked, the current "
"year is also ticked. In this example, it is :guilabel:`2025`."
msgstr ""
"В този пример желаните данни са сравнение между представянето на екипа през "
"третото тримесечие (юни – август) и второто тримесечие (април – юли). За "
"целта кликнете върху :guilabel:`Q3`. След кликването се отмята автоматично и "
"текущата година. В този пример това е :guilabel:`2025`."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/team_performance.rst:79
msgid ""
"After making this selection, a :icon:`fa-adjust` :guilabel:`Comparison` "
"column appears. Click :guilabel:`Start Date: Previous Period` to compare the "
"third quarter with the second quarter, for the various recruiters."
msgstr ""
"След като направите този избор, се появява колона :icon:`fa-adjust` "
":guilabel:`Comparison`. Кликнете върху :guilabel:`Start Date: Previous "
"Period`, за да сравните третото тримесечие с второто тримесечие за "
"различните специалисти по подбор."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/team_performance.rst:None
msgid "A comparison table of recruiter totals of Q2 and Q3."
msgstr ""
"Таблица за сравнение на общите показатели на специалистите по подбор за "
"второ и трето тримесечие."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/team_performance.rst:86
msgid ""
"From this report, some things can be extrapolated: the total number of "
"applicants, the number of hired applicants, the number of refused "
"applicants, and the number of applicants still in the recruitment pipeline "
"all increased."
msgstr ""
"От този отчет могат да се направят някои изводи: общият брой кандидати, "
"броят на наетите кандидати, броят на отказаните кандидати и броят на "
"кандидатите, все още намиращи се в процеса на подбор, са се увеличили."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/team_performance.rst:90
msgid ""
"Additionally, :guilabel:`Maggie Davidsons` had the highest increase in "
"number of hired applicants during the third quarter, while their number of "
"refused applicants went down."
msgstr ""
"Освен това :guilabel:`Maggie Davidsons` отбелязва най-голямото увеличение на "
"броя наети кандидати през третото тримесечие, докато броят на отказаните ѝ "
"кандидати намалява."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/velocity_analysis.rst:3
msgid "Velocity analysis"
msgstr "Анализ на скоростта"

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/velocity_analysis.rst:5
msgid ""
"The *Velocity Analysis* report provides information on how long applicants "
"stay in each stage of the recruitment process. This is important, as every "
"job position has specific :ref:`hiring process details <recruitment/new_job/"
"hiring-process>` that state the length of time applicants should expect to "
"wait between specific stages."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/velocity_analysis.rst:10
msgid ""
"Knowing how long applicants remain in each stage can help highlight possible "
"bottlenecks. Analyzing this data allows the recruitment team to assess each "
"stage, identify any issues, and pivot their strategies to move applicants "
"through each stage, within the expected time interval."
msgstr ""
"Знанието колко дълго кандидатите остават на всеки етап може да помогне за "
"откриване на възможни затруднения. Анализирането на тези данни позволява на "
"екипа по подбор на персонал да оцени всеки етап, да идентифицира евентуални "
"проблеми и да коригира стратегиите си, за да придвижва кандидатите през "
"всеки етап в рамките на очаквания времеви интервал."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/velocity_analysis.rst:15
msgid "Velocity analysis report"
msgstr "Отчет за анализ на скоростта"

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/velocity_analysis.rst:17
msgid ""
"To access the report, navigate to :menuselection:`Recruitment app --> "
"Reporting --> Velocity Analysis`. By default, the report displays data for "
"all job positions, with the stages populating the x-axis, and the number of "
"days populating the y-axis, in a :icon:`fa-line-chart` :guilabel:`(Line "
"Chart)`."
msgstr ""
"За достъп до отчета отидете на :menuselection:`Recruitment --> Reporting --> "
"Velocity Analysis`. По подразбиране отчетът показва данни за всички "
"длъжности, като етапите запълват оста X, а броят на дните — оста Y, под "
"формата на :icon:`fa-line-chart` :guilabel:`(Line Chart)`."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/velocity_analysis.rst:22
msgid ""
"The default filter is :guilabel:`Last 365 Days Applicant`, showing "
"information for the last 365 days."
msgstr ""
"Филтърът по подразбиране е :guilabel:`Last 365 Days Applicant`, показващ "
"информация за последните 365 дни."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/velocity_analysis.rst:25
msgid ""
"Hover over a stage in the line chart to reveal a popover window listing all "
"the job positions within it, and the average number of days each job "
"position sits in each stage."
msgstr ""
"Задръжте показалеца върху етап в линейната диаграма, за да се покаже "
"изскачащ прозорец, изброяващ всички длъжности в него и средния брой дни, "
"през които всяка длъжност престоява на всеки етап."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/velocity_analysis.rst:28
msgid ""
"For a more visually digestible view of the information in "
"the :guilabel:`Velocity Analysis` report, click the :icon:`fa-bar-"
"chart` :guilabel:`(Bar Chart)` icon in the upper-left corner. This displays "
"all the information in a bar chart."
msgstr ""
"За по-лесно за възприемане визуално представяне на информацията в отчета "
":guilabel:`Velocity Analysis`, кликнете върху иконата :icon:`fa-bar-chart` "
":guilabel:`(Bar Chart)` в горния ляв ъгъл. Това показва цялата информация "
"под формата на стълбовидна диаграма."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/velocity_analysis.rst:32
msgid ""
"In this view, it is easier to visualize the differences between the job "
"positions, regarding how long applicants stay in each stage. From this view, "
"recruiters can determine which job positions have delays or bottlenecks at "
"certain stages."
msgstr ""
"В този изглед е по-лесно да се визуализират разликите между длъжностите по "
"отношение на това колко дълго кандидатите остават на всеки етап. От този "
"изглед специалистите по подбор могат да определят кои длъжности имат "
"забавяния или затруднения на определени етапи."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/velocity_analysis.rst:None
msgid "The bar chart view of the Velocity Analysis report."
msgstr "Изгледът със стълбовидна диаграма на отчета за анализ на скоростта."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/velocity_analysis.rst:40
msgid "Use case: comparing times by month"
msgstr "Пример за употреба: сравняване на времената по месеци"

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/velocity_analysis.rst:42
msgid ""
"With the :guilabel:`Velocity Analysis` report, it is possible to see if "
"there are certain months where applicants take longer to be moved through "
"the pipeline. To view this data, switch to the :icon:`oi-view-"
"pivot` :guilabel:`(Pivot)` view in the upper-right corner."
msgstr ""
"С отчета :guilabel:`Velocity Analysis` е възможно да се провери дали има "
"определени месеци, в които на кандидатите им отнема повече време да преминат "
"през процеса на подбор. За да видите тези данни, превключете към изгледа "
":icon:`oi-view-pivot` :guilabel:`(Pivot)` в горния десен ъгъл."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/velocity_analysis.rst:46
msgid ""
"This presents the data in a detailed pivot table, with the rows representing "
"the different job positions, and the columns representing the stages. The "
"average :guilabel:`Days in Stage` populates the various boxes."
msgstr ""
"Това представя данните в подробна обобщена таблица, като редовете "
"представляват различните длъжности, а колоните — етапите. Средната стойност "
":guilabel:`Days in Stage` запълва отделните клетки."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/velocity_analysis.rst:51
msgid ""
"If a field is empty, it indicates no applicant has been in that stage. "
"Instead, all applicants moved from a previous stage without being placed in "
"the stage with an empty field."
msgstr ""
"Ако едно поле е празно, това означава, че нито един кандидат не е бил на "
"този етап. Вместо това всички кандидати са преминали от предходен етап, без "
"да бъдат поставяни на етапа с празното поле."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/velocity_analysis.rst:None
msgid "The pivot table view of the Velocity Analysis report."
msgstr "Изгледът с обобщена таблица на отчета за анализ на скоростта."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/velocity_analysis.rst:57
msgid ""
"Click :icon:`fa-minus-square-o` :guilabel:`Total` above the job position "
"rows to collapse the information. Next, click :icon:`fa-plus-"
"square` :guilabel:`Total` again, revealing a drop-down menu. "
"Click :guilabel:`Add Custom Group` :icon:`fa-caret-down` at the bottom of "
"the list, revealing further grouping options. Click :guilabel:`Start Date` "
"from the expanded list."
msgstr ""
"Кликнете върху :icon:`fa-minus-square-o` :guilabel:`Total` над редовете с "
"длъжности, за да свиете информацията. След това кликнете отново върху "
":icon:`fa-plus-square` :guilabel:`Total`, за да се покаже падащо меню. "
"Кликнете върху :guilabel:`Add Custom Group` :icon:`fa-caret-down` в долната "
"част на списъка, за да се покажат допълнителни опции за групиране. Изберете "
":guilabel:`Start Date` от разширения списък."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/velocity_analysis.rst:62
msgid ""
"After doing so, the data presented is grouped with the various months from "
"the previous 365 days for the rows, leaving the :guilabel:`Days In Stage` as "
"the columns."
msgstr ""
"След това представените данни се групират по различните месеци от последните "
"365 дни за редовете, като :guilabel:`Days In Stage` остава за колоните."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/velocity_analysis.rst:None
msgid "The pivot table showing the months averages for times in stage."
msgstr ""
"Обобщената таблица, показваща средните стойности по месеци за времето, "
"прекарано на всеки етап."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/velocity_analysis.rst:68
msgid ""
"In this example, :guilabel:`July 2024` had the longest time that applicants "
"spent in each stage, on average. In addition, the :guilabel:`Contract "
"Proposal` stage had the longest wait time in July, with an average "
"of :guilabel:`31.62` days in that stage."
msgstr ""
"В този пример :guilabel:`July 2024` е месецът, в който кандидатите средно са "
"прекарвали най-дълго време на всеки етап. Освен това етапът "
":guilabel:`Contract Proposal` е имал най-дългото време на изчакване през "
"юли, със средно :guilabel:`31.62` дни на този етап."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/velocity_analysis.rst:72
msgid ""
"While this report does not display the reasons applicants stayed in the "
"various stages for these lengths of time, it can be helpful to know when "
"delays occur."
msgstr ""
"Въпреки че този отчет не показва причините, поради които кандидатите са "
"оставали на различните етапи за тези периоди от време, е полезно да се знае "
"кога възникват забавяния."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/recruitment/velocity_analysis.rst:76
msgid ":doc:`Essentials reporting documentation <../../essentials/reporting>`"
msgstr ":doc:`Документация за основни отчети <../../essentials/reporting>`"

#: ../../content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:5
msgid "Referrals"
msgstr "Препоръки"

#: ../../content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:7
msgid ""
"Odoo's **Referrals** application is a centralized place where all "
"information regarding referrals is housed - from points earned, coworkers "
"hired, and rewards selected. Users can recommend people they know for job "
"positions, and then earn referral points as those people progress through "
"the recruitment pipeline. Once enough referral points are earned, they can "
"be exchanged for prizes. The **Employees**, **Recruitment**, and **Website** "
"apps must all be installed for the **Referrals** app to function."
msgstr ""
"Приложението **Referrals** на Odoo е централизирано място, където се "
"съхранява цялата информация, свързана с препоръките — от спечелени точки, "
"наети колеги, до избрани награди. Потребителите могат да препоръчват хора, "
"които познават, за длъжности, а след това да печелят точки за препоръки, "
"докато тези хора напредват в процеса на подбор. След като бъдат спечелени "
"достатъчно точки за препоръки, те могат да бъдат разменени за награди. За да "
"функционира приложението **Referrals**, трябва да са инсталирани "
"приложенията **Employees**, **Recruitment** и **Website**."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:14
msgid ""
"The only configurations needed for the **Referrals** app *after* it has been "
"installed, are related to the :doc:`rewards <referrals/rewards>`; everything "
"else is preconfigured when Odoo **Referrals** is installed."
msgstr ""
"Единствените настройки, необходими за приложението **Referrals** *след* като "
"е инсталирано, са свързани с :doc:`наградите <referrals/rewards>`; всичко "
"останало е предварително конфигурирано при инсталирането на Odoo "
"**Referrals**."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:18
msgid ""
"Users with either :guilabel:`Referral User`, :guilabel:`Officer`, "
"or :guilabel:`Administrator` access rights for the **Recruitment** app can "
"access the **Referrals** app. Only users with :guilabel:`Administrator` "
"access rights for the **Recruitment** app have access to the :doc:`referral "
"analysis <referrals/referral_analysis>` report and configuration menus. For "
"more information on users and access rights, refer to these "
"documents: :doc:`../general/users` and :doc:`../general/users/access_rights`."
msgstr ""
"Потребители с права за достъп :guilabel:`Referral User`, :guilabel:`Officer` "
"или :guilabel:`Administrator` за приложението **Recruitment** могат да имат "
"достъп до приложението **Referrals**. Само потребители с права за достъп "
":guilabel:`Administrator` за приложението **Recruitment** имат достъп до "
"отчета :doc:`анализ на препоръките <referrals/referral_analysis>` и менютата "
"за настройки. За повече информация относно потребителите и правата за достъп "
"вижте следните документи: :doc:`../general/users` и :doc:`../general/users/"
"access_rights`."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:30
msgid ""
"When opening the **Referrals** app for the first time, a preconfigured "
"onboarding script appears. This script consists of four slides, each "
"explaining the different parts of the **Referrals** app. At the top of the "
"dashboard, the following message is displayed throughout all the onboarding "
"slides: :guilabel:`GATHER YOUR TEAM! Job Referral Program`. Behind this main "
"message is an image, and beneath it some more explanatory text."
msgstr ""
"При отваряне на приложението **Referrals** за първи път се появява "
"предварително конфигуриран сценарий за въвеждане. Този сценарий се състои от "
"четири слайда, всеки от които обяснява различните части на приложението "
"**Referrals**. В горната част на таблото следното съобщение се показва по "
"време на всички слайдове за въвеждане: :guilabel:`GATHER YOUR TEAM! Job "
"Referral Program`. Зад това основно съобщение има изображение, а под него — "
"допълнителен обяснителен текст."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:36
msgid ""
"Each of the onboarding slides has a corresponding image and message that is "
"displayed. After reading each message, click the :guilabel:`Next` :icon:`fa-"
"angle-right` button to advance to the next slide."
msgstr ""
"Всеки от слайдовете за въвеждане има съответно изображение и съобщение, "
"което се показва. След прочитане на всяко съобщение, кликнете върху бутона "
":guilabel:`Next` :icon:`fa-angle-right`, за да преминете към следващия слайд."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:39
msgid "The text that appears on each slide is as follows:"
msgstr "Текстът, който се появява на всеки слайд, е следният:"

#: ../../content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:41
msgid ""
":guilabel:`OH NO! VILLAINS ARE LURKING THE CITY! HELP US RECRUIT A TEAM OF "
"SUPERHEROES TO SAVE THE DAY!`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:43
msgid ""
":guilabel:`BROWSE THROUGH OPEN JOB POSITIONS, PROMOTE THEM ON SOCIAL MEDIA, "
"OR REFER FRIENDS.`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:44
msgid ""
":guilabel:`COLLECT POINTS AND EXCHANGE THEM FOR AWESOME GIFTS IN THE SHOP.`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:45
msgid ""
":guilabel:`COMPETE AGAINST YOUR COLLEAGUES TO BUILD THE BEST JUSTICE LEAGUE!`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:48
msgid ""
"The onboarding slides will appear every time the **Referrals** app is "
"opened, until all the slides have been viewed and the :guilabel:`Start Now` "
"button has been clicked. If the onboarding is exited at any point, or if "
"the :guilabel:`Start Now` button has *not* been clicked, the onboarding "
"slides will begin again when the **Referrals** app is opened. Once "
"the :guilabel:`Start Now` button has been clicked, the onboarding slides "
"will not be seen again, and the main dashboard will load when the "
"**Referrals** app is opened from that point on."
msgstr ""
"Слайдовете за въвеждане ще се показват всеки път при отваряне на "
"приложението **Referrals**, докато не бъдат прегледани всички слайдове и не "
"бъде кликнат бутонът :guilabel:`Start Now`. Ако въвеждането бъде прекратено "
"в даден момент, или ако бутонът :guilabel:`Start Now` *не* е бил кликнат, "
"слайдовете за въвеждане ще започнат отново при отваряне на приложението "
"**Referrals**. След като бъде кликнат бутонът :guilabel:`Start Now`, "
"слайдовете за въвеждане няма да се показват повече, а от този момент нататък "
"при отваряне на приложението **Referrals** ще се зарежда основното табло."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:55
msgid ""
"At any point during onboarding, click the :guilabel:`Skip` button to open "
"the main **Referrals** dashboard."
msgstr ""
"По всяко време по време на въвеждането кликнете върху бутона "
":guilabel:`Skip`, за да отворите основното табло на **Referrals**."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:None
msgid ""
"An onboarding slide with the skip and next buttons visible at the bottom."
msgstr ""
"Слайд за въвеждане с видими бутони за пропускане и напред в долната част."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:62
msgid ""
"If there are any candidates hired that the user had referred prior to "
"opening the **Referrals** app (meaning the onboarding slides have not "
"appeared before), when :guilabel:`Start Now` is clicked at the end of "
"onboarding, instead of going to the main dashboard, a :ref:`hired <referrals/"
"hired>` screen appears instead."
msgstr ""
"Ако има наети кандидати, които потребителят е препоръчал преди отварянето на "
"приложението **Referrals** (т.е. слайдовете за въвеждане не са се показвали "
"преди), при кликване върху :guilabel:`Start Now` в края на въвеждането, "
"вместо основното табло се показва екранът :ref:`нает <referrals/hired>`."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:68
msgid "Modifying onboarding slides"
msgstr "Промяна на слайдовете за въвеждане"

#: ../../content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:70
msgid ""
"Onboarding slides can be modified if desired. Only users "
"with :guilabel:`Administrator` rights for the **Recruitment** app can modify "
"onboarding slides. To edit a slide, navigate to :menuselection:`Referrals "
"app --> Configuration --> Onboarding.` Each line displays the text for the "
"individual onboarding slide. To edit an onboarding slide, click on an "
"individual slide line to open the slide's onboarding form."
msgstr ""
"Слайдовете за въвеждане могат да бъдат променяни, ако е необходимо. Само "
"потребители с права :guilabel:`Administrator` за приложението "
"**Recruitment** могат да променят слайдовете за въвеждане. За да редактирате "
"слайд, отидете на :menuselection:`Referrals --> Configuration --> "
"Onboarding.` Всеки ред показва текста за съответния слайд за въвеждане. За "
"да редактирате слайд за въвеждане, кликнете върху конкретния ред на слайда, "
"за да отворите формуляра за въвеждане на слайда."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:76
msgid ""
"Make any changes to the message in the :guilabel:`Text` field. "
"A :guilabel:`Company` may be selected, as well. However, if this field is "
"populated, that slide is *only* displayed for that particular company."
msgstr ""
"Направете желаните промени в съобщението в полето :guilabel:`Text`. Може да "
"бъде избрана и :guilabel:`Company`. Ако обаче това поле е попълнено, слайдът "
"се показва *само* за конкретната фирма."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:81
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Company` field only appears when in a multi-company database."
msgstr ""
"Полето :guilabel:`Company` се показва само в база данни с няколко фирми."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:83
msgid ""
"The image can be modified, as well. Hover over the image thumbnail in the "
"top-right corner of the form. An :icon:`fa-pencil` :guilabel:`(Edit)` icon "
"and :icon:`fa-trash-o` :guilabel:`(Clear)` icon appear. Click the :icon:`fa-"
"pencil` :guilabel:`(Edit)` icon to change the image. A file navigator window "
"loads. Navigate to the desired image, select it, then "
"click :guilabel:`Open`. The new image appears in the thumbnail. To delete an "
"image, click the :icon:`fa-trash-o` :guilabel:`(Clear)` icon, then select a "
"new image using the :icon:`fa-pencil` :guilabel:`(Edit)` icon."
msgstr ""
"Изображението също може да бъде променено. Задръжте показалеца върху "
"миниатюрата на изображението в горния десен ъгъл на формуляра. Появяват се "
"икона :icon:`fa-pencil` :guilabel:`(Edit)` и икона :icon:`fa-trash-o` "
":guilabel:`(Clear)`. Кликнете върху иконата :icon:`fa-pencil` :guilabel:`"
"(Edit)`, за да смените изображението. Зарежда се прозорец за навигация на "
"файлове. Намерете желаното изображение, изберете го, след което кликнете "
"върху :guilabel:`Open`. Новото изображение се появява в миниатюрата. За да "
"изтриете изображение, кликнете върху иконата :icon:`fa-trash-o` :guilabel:`"
"(Clear)`, след което изберете ново изображение чрез иконата :icon:`fa-"
"pencil` :guilabel:`(Edit)`."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:None
msgid "An onboarding slide in edit mode, with the main fields highlighted."
msgstr "Слайд за въвеждане в режим на редактиране, с маркирани основни полета."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:93
msgid ""
"The sequence in which the slides appear can be changed from the *Onboarding* "
"dashboard. Click the :icon:`oi-draggable` :guilabel:`(draggable)` icon to "
"the left of the slide text, and drag the slide to the desired position."
msgstr ""
"Последователността, в която се показват слайдовете, може да бъде променена "
"от таблото *Onboarding*. Кликнете върху иконата :icon:`oi-draggable` "
":guilabel:`(draggable)` вляво от текста на слайда и го провлачете до "
"желаната позиция."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:None
msgid ""
"The onboarding slides in a list, with the drag and drop arrows highlighted."
msgstr ""
"Слайдовете за въвеждане в списък, с маркирани стрелки за влачене и пускане."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:103
msgid "Hired referrals"
msgstr "Наети чрез препоръка"

#: ../../content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:105
msgid ""
"When a candidate referred by a user is hired, the user *\"grows their "
"superhero team\"* and adds superhero avatars to their **Referrals** "
"dashboard."
msgstr ""
"Когато бъде нает кандидат, препоръчан от потребител, потребителят *„"
"разраства своя отбор от супергерои“* и добавя аватари на супергерои към "
"своето табло в **Referrals**."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:108
msgid ""
"After a referral has been hired, when the user next opens the **Referrals** "
"app, instead of the main dashboard, a hired page loads. The "
"text :guilabel:`(REFERRAL NAME) HAS BEEN HIRED! Choose an avatar for your "
"new friend!` appears."
msgstr ""
"След като препоръчан кандидат бъде нает, при следващото отваряне на "
"приложението **Referrals** от потребителя, вместо основното табло, се "
"зарежда страница за наети. Показва се текстът :guilabel:`(REFERRAL NAME) HAS "
"BEEN HIRED! Choose an avatar for your new friend!`"

#: ../../content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:112
msgid ""
"Below this message are five avatar thumbnails to choose from. If an avatar "
"has already been assigned to a referral, the thumbnail is grayed out, and "
"the name that the avatar has been chosen for appears beneath the avatar. "
"Click on an available avatar to select it."
msgstr ""
"Под това съобщение има пет миниатюри на аватари за избор. Ако даден аватар "
"вече е бил присвоен на препоръка, миниатюрата е показана в сиво, а името, за "
"което е избран аватарът, се показва под него. Кликнете върху наличен аватар, "
"за да го изберете."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:116
msgid ""
"If more than one referral was hired since completing onboarding in the "
"**Referrals** app, after selecting the first avatar, the user is prompted to "
"select another avatar for the subsequent hired referral. Once all avatars "
"have been selected, the dashboard loads and all the avatars are now visible. "
"Mouse over each avatar and their name is displayed above them."
msgstr ""
"Ако повече от една препоръка е била наета след завършване на въвеждането в "
"приложението **Referrals**, след избора на първия аватар потребителят бива "
"подканен да избере друг аватар за следващата наета препоръка. След като "
"всички аватари бъдат избрани, таблото се зарежда и всички аватари вече са "
"видими. Задръжте показалеца върху всеки аватар и над него ще се покаже "
"съответното име."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:None
msgid ""
"The hired screen. A selection of avatars are presented to choose from, with "
"any already\n"
"chosen are greyed out."
msgstr ""
"Екранът за наети. Показва се набор от аватари за избор, като вече избраните\n"
"са показани в сиво."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:126
msgid "Modify friends"
msgstr "Промяна на приятели"

#: ../../content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:128
msgid ""
"Friend avatars are able to be modified in the same manner that :ref:`levels "
"<referrals/levels>` are modified. Only users with :guilabel:`Administrator` "
"rights for the **Recruitment** app can make modifications to friends. The "
"preconfigured friends can be seen and modified by navigating "
"to :menuselection:`Referrals app --> Configuration --> Friends`. Each "
"friend's avatar appears in the :guilabel:`Dashboard Image` column, and the "
"corresponding name appears in the :guilabel:`Friend Name` column. The "
"default images are a motley group of hero characters, ranging from robots to "
"dogs."
msgstr ""
"Аватарите на приятелите могат да бъдат променяни по същия начин, по който се "
"променят :ref:`нивата <referrals/levels>`. Само потребители с права "
":guilabel:`Administrator` за приложението **Recruitment** могат да правят "
"промени по приятелите. Предварително конфигурираните приятели могат да бъдат "
"прегледани и променяни, като отидете на :menuselection:`Referrals --> "
"Configuration --> Friends`. Аватарът на всеки приятел се показва в колоната "
":guilabel:`Dashboard Image`, а съответното име се показва в колоната "
":guilabel:`Friend Name`. Изображенията по подразбиране представляват пъстра "
"група от героични персонажи, вариращи от роботи до кучета."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:135
msgid ""
"To modify a friend's dashboard image, thumbnail, name, or position, click on "
"an individual friend to open the referral friend form. Type the name in "
"the :guilabel:`Friend Name` field. The name is solely to differentiate the "
"friends in the configuration menu; the friend's name is not visible anywhere "
"else in the **Referrals** app."
msgstr ""
"За да промените изображението за табло, миниатюрата, името или позицията на "
"приятел, кликнете върху конкретен приятел, за да отворите формуляра за "
"приятел от препоръките. Въведете името в полето :guilabel:`Friend Name`. "
"Името служи единствено за разграничаване на приятелите в менюто за "
"настройки; името на приятеля не се показва никъде другаде в приложението "
"**Referrals**."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:140
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Position` can be set to either :guilabel:`Front` "
"or :guilabel:`Back`. This determines the position of the friend in relation "
"to the user's super hero avatar. Click the radio button next to the desired "
"selection, and the friend will appear either in front of or behind the "
"user's avatar when activated."
msgstr ""
"Полето :guilabel:`Position` може да бъде зададено на :guilabel:`Front` или "
":guilabel:`Back`. Това определя позицията на приятеля спрямо аватара на "
"супергероя на потребителя. Кликнете върху радио бутона до желания избор и "
"при активиране приятелят ще се показва отпред или отзад спрямо аватара на "
"потребителя."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:145
msgid ""
"If desired, both the thumbnail :guilabel:`Image` and "
"the :guilabel:`Dashboard Image` can be modified. Hover over the image being "
"replaced to reveal an  :icon:`fa-pencil` :guilabel:`(Edit)` icon "
"and :icon:`fa-trash-o` :guilabel:`(Clear)` icon. Click the :icon:`fa-"
"pencil` :guilabel:`(Edit)` icon, and a file explorer window appears. "
"Navigate to the desired image file, then click :guilabel:`Open` to select it."
msgstr ""
"Ако желаете, могат да бъдат променени както миниатюрното :guilabel:`Image`, "
"така и :guilabel:`Dashboard Image`. Задръжте показалеца върху изображението, "
"което ще бъде заменено, за да се покажат икона :icon:`fa-pencil` :guilabel:`"
"(Edit)` и икона :icon:`fa-trash-o` :guilabel:`(Clear)`. Кликнете върху "
"иконата :icon:`fa-pencil` :guilabel:`(Edit)` и ще се появи прозорец на "
"файловия мениджър. Намерете желания файл с изображение, след което кликнете "
"върху :guilabel:`Open`, за да го изберете."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:151
#: ../../content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:220
msgid ""
"To cancel any changes made, click the :icon:`fa-times` :guilabel:`(Discard "
"all changes)` icon to delete any changes, and revert to the original content."
msgstr ""
"За да отмените направените промени, кликнете върху иконата :icon:`fa-times` "
":guilabel:`(Discard all changes)`, за да изтриете промените и да се върнете "
"към оригиналното съдържание."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:None
msgid "A friend form in edit mode."
msgstr "Формуляр за приятел в режим на редактиране."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:158
#: ../../content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:192
msgid ""
"It is not advised to edit the images. An image file must have a transparent "
"background in order for it to render properly. Only users with knowledge "
"about transparent images should attempt adjusting any images in the "
"**Referrals** app."
msgstr ""
"Не се препоръчва редактирането на изображенията. Файлът с изображение трябва "
"да има прозрачен фон, за да се визуализира правилно. Само потребители с "
"познания относно изображения с прозрачност трябва да опитват да коригират "
"изображения в приложението **Referrals**."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:162
msgid ""
"Once an image is changed and the friend is saved, it is **not possible** to "
"revert to the original image. To revert to the original image, the "
"**Referrals** app must be *uninstalled then reinstalled.*"
msgstr ""
"След като изображението бъде сменено и приятелят бъде запазен, **не е "
"възможно** връщане към оригиналното изображение. За да се върнете към "
"оригиналното изображение, приложението **Referrals** трябва да бъде "
"*деинсталирано и след това инсталирано отново.*"

#: ../../content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:169
msgid "Levels"
msgstr "Нива"

#: ../../content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:171
msgid ""
"The **Referrals** app has preconfigured levels that are reflected in the "
"user's avatar on the **Referrals** dashboard. As a user refers potential "
"employees and earns points, they can *level up*, much like in a video game."
msgstr ""
"Приложението **Referrals** разполага с предварително конфигурирани нива, "
"които се отразяват в аватара на потребителя в таблото на **Referrals**. "
"Докато потребителят препоръчва потенциални служители и печели точки, той "
"може да *повишава нивото си*, подобно на видеоигра."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:176
msgid ""
"Levels have no functional impact on the performance of the app. They are "
"solely used for the purpose of adding achievement tiers for participants to "
"aim for, gamifying referrals for the user."
msgstr ""
"Нивата нямат функционално влияние върху работата на приложението. Те се "
"използват единствено с цел добавяне на нива на постижения, към които "
"участниците да се стремят, като по този начин геймифицират препоръките за "
"потребителя."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:180
msgid ""
"The user's current level is displayed at the top of the main **Referrals** "
"app dashboard, directly beneath their photo, in a :guilabel:`Level: #` "
"format. In addition, a colored ring appears around the user's photo, "
"indicating how many points the user currently has, and how many additional "
"points they need to level up. The cyan colored portion of the ring "
"represents points earned, while the white colored portion represents the "
"points still needed before they can level up."
msgstr ""
"Текущото ниво на потребителя се показва в горната част на основното табло на "
"приложението **Referrals**, непосредствено под снимката му, във формат "
":guilabel:`Level: #`. Освен това около снимката на потребителя се показва "
"цветен пръстен, който показва колко точки има потребителят в момента и колко "
"допълнителни точки са му необходими, за да повиши нивото си. Оцветената в "
"циан част от пръстена представлява спечелените точки, докато бялата част "
"представлява точките, които все още са необходими, преди да може да повиши "
"нивото си."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:187
msgid "Modify levels"
msgstr "Промяна на нива"

#: ../../content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:189
msgid ""
"Only users with :guilabel:`Administrator` rights for the **Recruitment** app "
"can modify levels."
msgstr ""
"Само потребители с права :guilabel:`Administrator` за приложението "
"**Recruitment** могат да променят нивата."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:196
msgid ""
"Once an image is changed and the level is saved, it is **not possible** to "
"revert to the original image. To revert to the original image, the "
"**Referrals** app must be *uninstalled then reinstalled.*"
msgstr ""
"След като изображението бъде сменено и нивото бъде запазено, **не е "
"възможно** връщане към оригиналното изображение. За да се върнете към "
"оригиналното изображение, приложението **Referrals** трябва да бъде "
"*деинсталирано и след това инсталирано отново.*"

#: ../../content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:200
msgid ""
"The preconfigured levels can be seen and modified by navigating "
"to :menuselection:`Referrals app --> Configuration --> Levels`. Each avatar "
"appears in the :guilabel:`Image` column, and the corresponding level number "
"appears in the :guilabel:`Level Name` column. The default images are of Odoo "
"superheroes, and each level adds an additional element to their avatar, such "
"as capes and shields."
msgstr ""
"Предварително конфигурираните нива могат да бъдат прегледани и променяни, "
"като отидете на :menuselection:`Referrals --> Configuration --> Levels`. "
"Всеки аватар се показва в колоната :guilabel:`Image`, а съответният номер на "
"ниво се показва в колоната :guilabel:`Level Name`. Изображенията по "
"подразбиране са на супергерои на Odoo, като всяко ниво добавя допълнителен "
"елемент към техния аватар, като например наметала и щитове."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:206
msgid ""
"To modify a level's image, name, or points required to reach the level, "
"click on an individual level in the list to open the level form, then make "
"modifications."
msgstr ""
"За да промените изображението, името или необходимите точки за достигане на "
"дадено ниво, кликнете върху конкретно ниво в списъка, за да отворите "
"формуляра за нивото, след което направете промените."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:209
msgid ""
"Type in the name (or number) of the level in the :guilabel:`Level Name` "
"field. What is entered is displayed beneath the user's photo on the main "
"dashboard when they reach that level. Enter the number of referral points "
"needed to reach that level in the :guilabel:`Requirements` field. The points "
"needed to level up are the total accumulated points earned over the lifetime "
"of the employee, not additional points from the previous level that must be "
"earned."
msgstr ""
"Въведете името (или номера) на нивото в полето :guilabel:`Level Name`. "
"Въведеното се показва под снимката на потребителя в основното табло, когато "
"той достигне това ниво. Въведете броя точки за препоръки, необходими за "
"достигане на това ниво, в полето :guilabel:`Requirements`. Точките, "
"необходими за повишаване на нивото, представляват общо натрупаните точки, "
"спечелени през целия период на служителя, а не допълнителни точки от "
"предходното ниво, които трябва да бъдат спечелени."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:215
msgid ""
"If desired, the :guilabel:`Image` can also be modified. Hover over the image "
"to reveal an :icon:`fa-pencil` :guilabel:`(Edit)` icon and a :icon:`fa-trash-"
"o` :guilabel:`(Clear)` icon. Click the :icon:`fa-pencil` :guilabel:`(Edit)` "
"icon and a file explorer window appears. Navigate to the desired image file, "
"then click :guilabel:`Open` to select it."
msgstr ""
"Ако желаете, :guilabel:`Image` също може да бъде променено. Задръжте "
"показалеца върху изображението, за да се покажат икона :icon:`fa-pencil` "
":guilabel:`(Edit)` и икона :icon:`fa-trash-o` :guilabel:`(Clear)`. Кликнете "
"върху иконата :icon:`fa-pencil` :guilabel:`(Edit)` и ще се появи прозорец на "
"файловия мениджър. Намерете желания файл с изображение, след което кликнете "
"върху :guilabel:`Open`, за да го изберете."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:None
msgid "A level form in edit mode."
msgstr "Формуляр за ниво в режим на редактиране."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:227
msgid "Level up"
msgstr "Повишаване на ниво"

#: ../../content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:229
msgid ""
"Once enough points have been accumulated to level up, the circle around the "
"user's photo is completely filled in with a cyan color, a large image "
"stating :guilabel:`LEVEL UP!` appears above the photo, and the "
"phrase :guilabel:`CLICK TO LEVEL UP!` appears beneath the user's photo and "
"current level."
msgstr ""
"След като бъдат натрупани достатъчно точки за повишаване на нивото, кръгът "
"около снимката на потребителя се запълва изцяло в циан цвят, над снимката се "
"появява голямо изображение с надпис :guilabel:`LEVEL UP!`, а под снимката и "
"текущото ниво на потребителя се появява фразата :guilabel:`CLICK TO LEVEL "
"UP!`"

#: ../../content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:234
msgid ""
"Click on either the :guilabel:`LEVEL UP!` graphic, the user's photo, or the "
"text :guilabel:`CLICK TO LEVEL UP!` beneath the user's photo to level up the "
"user. The user's avatar changes to the current level, and the ring around "
"the photo is updated to indicate the current amount of points."
msgstr ""
"Кликнете върху графиката :guilabel:`LEVEL UP!`, снимката на потребителя или "
"текста :guilabel:`CLICK TO LEVEL UP!` под снимката на потребителя, за да "
"повишите нивото на потребителя. Аватарът на потребителя се променя според "
"текущото ниво, а пръстенът около снимката се обновява, за да покаже текущото "
"количество точки."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:238
msgid ""
"Leveling up does not cost the user any points, the user only needs to earn "
"the specified amount of points required."
msgstr ""
"Повишаването на нивото не струва на потребителя никакви точки, потребителят "
"само трябва да спечели посочения необходим брой точки."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:None
msgid ""
"A 'Click to level up!' appears beneath the user's image, and a large 'Level "
"up!' appears\n"
"above their image."
msgstr ""
"Надпис „Кликни, за да повишиш нивото!“ се появява под изображението на "
"потребителя, а голям надпис „Повиши нивото!“ се появява\n"
"над изображението му."

#: ../../content/applications/hr/referrals.rst:246
msgid ""
"Once a user has reached the highest configured level, they will continue to "
"accrue points that can be redeemed for rewards, but they are no longer able "
"to level up. The ring around their photo remains solid cyan."
msgstr ""
"След като потребителят достигне най-високото конфигурирано ниво, той "
"продължава да натрупва точки, които могат да бъдат разменяни за награди, но "
"вече не може да повишава нивото си. Пръстенът около снимката му остава "
"изцяло в циан цвят."

